(2109666, 286400, 50531, '<td valign="top">Very nice and Gentle setting great shot and idea !</td>', 'Very nice and Gentle setting great shot and idea !', '2006-02-01 09:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2109674, 286792, 50531, '<td valign="top">Romance is to live and Fade together like your Idea love it</td>', 'Romance is to live and Fade together like your Idea love it', '2006-02-01 09:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2109676, 289151, 43824, '<td valign="top">that is awesome!</td>', 'that is awesome!', '2006-02-01 09:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2109684, 289166, 43824, '<td valign="top">i like the lighting</td>', 'i like the lighting', '2006-02-01 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2109715, 285822, 43824, '<td valign="top">very cool angle!</td>', 'very cool angle!', '2006-02-01 09:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2109719, 287351, 43824, '<td valign="top">catchy title...good framing!</td>', 'catchy title...good framing!', '2006-02-01 09:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2109720, 289422, 50531, '<td valign="top">Bravo love the idea more color would be nice</td>', 'Bravo love the idea more color would be nice', '2006-02-01 09:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2109734, 286857, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry, not particularly fond of the flare, I think this idea is good but isn´t really working this time, just that the sunflare seems to be the main focus of this shot and not the couple.  I would also try a different composition next time or crop the photo as the sun is in the dead center of the shot and the sign and whatever that is in the right side of the photo is pretty distracting.  Just wanted to explain why I only gave this a 3 but like I said, I like the idea and I encourage you to explore this some more.</td>', 'Sorry, not particularly fond of the flare, I think this idea is good but isn´t really working this time, just that the sunflare seems to be the main focus of this shot and not the couple.  I would also try a different composition next time or crop the photo as the sun is in the dead center of the shot and the sign and whatever that is in the right side of the photo is pretty distracting.  Just wanted to explain why I only gave this a 3 but like I said, I like the idea and I encourage you to explore this some more.', '2006-02-01 09:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2109756, 288400, 50531, '<td valign="top">neat idea</td>', 'neat idea', '2006-02-01 09:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2109794, 287552, 52557, '<td valign="top">I love these swans. Lovely pic :D</td>', 'I love these swans. Lovely pic :D', '2006-02-01 10:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2109840, 289151, 51974, '<td valign="top">Great concept and great picture.</td>', 'Great concept and great picture.', '2006-02-01 10:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2109864, 288783, 41091, '<td valign="top">Nice pun on the words here.</td>', 'Nice pun on the words here.', '2006-02-01 10:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2109889, 288051, 5728, '<td valign="top">Well done, one of my pics for a ribbon this one, good work!</td>', 'Well done, one of my pics for a ribbon this one, good work!', '2006-02-01 10:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2109904, 289376, 42826, '<td valign="top">nice and simple</td>', 'nice and simple', '2006-02-01 10:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2109909, 288645, 28699, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.</td>', 'Wonderful shot.', '2006-02-01 10:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2109916, 287762, 46177, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, like a romantic painting by one of the masters.  A 10 from me and a favorite.</td>', 'Beautiful image, like a romantic painting by one of the masters.  A 10 from me and a favorite.', '2006-02-01 10:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2109931, 285960, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cute girls :)  No way I could give this a high score though, I am too obsessed with image quality and just simply isn´t a great image from that standpoint, it´s just too badly out of focus and the colour tones too purple for my taste.  Still gave this a 5 because I like the intimacy between them and the composition.</td>', 'Cute girls :)  No way I could give this a high score though, I am too obsessed with image quality and just simply isn´t a great image from that standpoint, it´s just too badly out of focus and the colour tones too purple for my taste.  Still gave this a 5 because I like the intimacy between them and the composition.', '2006-02-01 10:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2109949, 288833, 27482, '<td valign="top">Too bad the backround isn´t completely white, it certainly detracts from this shot, otherwise pretty good, gave it a 6.</td>', 'Too bad the backround isn´t completely white, it certainly detracts from this shot, otherwise pretty good, gave it a 6.', '2006-02-01 10:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2109971, 289151, 41091, '<td valign="top">nice concept and pun</td>', 'nice concept and pun', '2006-02-01 10:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2109973, 288609, 24169, '<td valign="top">The composition is great! I love the reflection as well. I don''t know if I would have liked to have seen the people facing away or not? I don''t like the fact that the person on the left seems to be talking (open mouthed) but then I''m just being fussy! Overall I like it.</td>', 'The composition is great! I love the reflection as well. I don''t know if I would have liked to have seen the people facing away or not? I don''t like the fact that the person on the left seems to be talking (open mouthed) but then I''m just being fussy! Overall I like it.', '2006-02-01 10:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2109996, 288687, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad at all, got a 6 from me but I would have liked this image even better if the sunset were more spectacular, couldn´t you have increased the reds a little bit, perhaps by faking a warmer WB?</td>', 'Not bad at all, got a 6 from me but I would have liked this image even better if the sunset were more spectacular, couldn´t you have increased the reds a little bit, perhaps by faking a warmer WB?', '2006-02-01 10:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110001, 289421, 24169, '<td valign="top">I can''t put my finger on it but it seems a little flat to me! Sorry.</td>', 'I can''t put my finger on it but it seems a little flat to me! Sorry.', '2006-02-01 10:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110008, 289174, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the B/W conversion but I have a nagging feeling I still would have liked this better in colour but I like this, got an 6 from me.</td>', 'Nice job on the B/W conversion but I have a nagging feeling I still would have liked this better in colour but I like this, got an 6 from me.', '2006-02-01 10:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110033, 287714, 24169, '<td valign="top">Very sweet. Maybe too tight a crop for my liking. . .</td>', 'Very sweet. Maybe too tight a crop for my liking. . .', '2006-02-01 10:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110041, 288609, 41091, '<td valign="top">sweet sassy mo lassy HEHE very nice</td>', 'sweet sassy mo lassy HEHE very nice', '2006-02-01 10:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110042, 285822, 21216, '<td valign="top">This picture is beautiful! With or even without motion blur. The blur did add some action to the shot but it would have been perfect without it as well.</td>', 'This picture is beautiful! With or even without motion blur. The blur did add some action to the shot but it would have been perfect without it as well.', '2006-02-01 10:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110046, 288051, 27482, '<td valign="top">Spectacular sunset, the best I have seen so far in the challenge but I am only about 16 images in so far.  Enough for a 7 from me and I am pretty demanding :)</td>', 'Spectacular sunset, the best I have seen so far in the challenge but I am only about 16 images in so far.  Enough for a 7 from me and I am pretty demanding :)', '2006-02-01 10:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110048, 289294, 43869, '<td valign="top">Perfect!   I love the creativity!</td>', 'Perfect!   I love the creativity!', '2006-02-01 10:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110084, 289108, 21216, '<td valign="top">Looks like a simple snapshot. The vignetting is very unecessary. <br/> <br/>You got the couple, you got the subject, you got the potential. What you could have done is chosen a better setting, used a better light and not flash and closened up onto the kiss.</td>', 'Looks like a simple snapshot. The vignetting is very unecessary.  You got the couple, you got the subject, you got the potential. What you could have done is chosen a better setting, used a better light and not flash and closened up onto the kiss.', '2006-02-01 10:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110090, 288621, 21216, '<td valign="top">There''s just so many things that look wrong in this picture.... <br/> <br/>But it does have great potential :)</td>', 'There''s just so many things that look wrong in this picture....  But it does have great potential :)', '2006-02-01 10:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110104, 289294, 52472, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Too bad that the upper corners are over-exposed</td>', 'Great idea! Too bad that the upper corners are over-exposed', '2006-02-01 10:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110120, 288642, 21216, '<td valign="top">It''s a really well thought out picture, and really well executed but it needs a little post-processing.</td>', 'It''s a really well thought out picture, and really well executed but it needs a little post-processing.', '2006-02-01 11:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110192, 288819, 52472, '<td valign="top">The only flaw IMHO is that she looks like not knowing how to play a cello... but definitively Romantic!</td>', 'The only flaw IMHO is that she looks like not knowing how to play a cello... but definitively Romantic!', '2006-02-01 11:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110200, 288051, 22379, '<td valign="top">The sky is really the impact of this photo. What a beautiful sunset. I do think this image would have worked 2 ways with the poses the chi;ldren are in - i can see the title being changed to nernerner and it being comedic as her pucker in silhouette looks a lot like she is leaning forward and blowing a raspberry in his face. For that reason, i wish the young man was reacting too her rather than smiling away. It is however, lovely, and will place in the top of the pack.</td>', 'The sky is really the impact of this photo. What a beautiful sunset. I do think this image would have worked 2 ways with the poses the chi;ldren are in - i can see the title being changed to nernerner and it being comedic as her pucker in silhouette looks a lot like she is leaning forward and blowing a raspberry in his face. For that reason, i wish the young man was reacting too her rather than smiling away. It is however, lovely, and will place in the top of the pack.', '2006-02-01 11:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110210, 287123, 22379, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition. The light falls nicely on her, but seems a little monotonous on his back. A little too much NI for my taste, but a very senuous reprsenation of the theme.</td>', 'Lovely composition. The light falls nicely on her, but seems a little monotonous on his back. A little too much NI for my taste, but a very senuous reprsenation of the theme.', '2006-02-01 11:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110217, 289376, 22379, '<td valign="top">Love the concept- VERY original. Am a little bothered by the vignetting of blue in the corners.</td>', 'Love the concept- VERY original. Am a little bothered by the vignetting of blue in the corners.', '2006-02-01 11:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110223, 288609, 52472, '<td valign="top">I like the heart shape they almost form with their arms and heads. A bit too much kitsch. On the other hand, romance often is for the spectator.</td>', 'I like the heart shape they almost form with their arms and heads. A bit too much kitsch. On the other hand, romance often is for the spectator.', '2006-02-01 11:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110263, 288400, 24013, '<td valign="top">love the quality of this photo.  not sure the theme fits for me, it''s a stretch.  but great shot.  great effect.</td>', 'love the quality of this photo.  not sure the theme fits for me, it''s a stretch.  but great shot.  great effect.', '2006-02-01 11:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110317, 289258, 47151, '<td valign="top">A little bit of backlighting to enhance the dry ice effect would have helped this image. Also the red channel seems to have alot of noise. I love the concept but it just seems the photo is lacking in the punch needed.</td>', 'A little bit of backlighting to enhance the dry ice effect would have helped this image. Also the red channel seems to have alot of noise. I love the concept but it just seems the photo is lacking in the punch needed.', '2006-02-01 11:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110354, 289424, 15711, '<td valign="top">CUTE!!!! Are they also in 107?? hee hee Maybe it''s a different couple.  Good job. 7</td>', 'CUTE!!!! Are they also in 107?? hee hee Maybe it''s a different couple.  Good job. 7', '2006-02-01 11:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110363, 288609, 40376, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, nicely framed and a lovely sunset but I''d liked to have seen the footprints in the sand also. Almost looks like they are walking on water.<br/>7.</td>', 'Nice photo, nicely framed and a lovely sunset but I''d liked to have seen the footprints in the sand also. Almost looks like they are walking on water.7.', '2006-02-01 12:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110370, 288645, 15711, '<td valign="top">AWWWW.  Lovely light.  I think I''d crop out the grass and zoom in on their upper bodies.  Such a sweet image. 7</td>', 'AWWWW.  Lovely light.  I think I''d crop out the grass and zoom in on their upper bodies.  Such a sweet image. 7', '2006-02-01 12:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110372, 287453, 15711, '<td valign="top">Tres interresante!!!</td>', 'Tres interresante!!!', '2006-02-01 12:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110378, 289197, 15711, '<td valign="top">Mystical - I see you back there. hee hee  Nice DOF!!!  Love the flower colors.</td>', 'Mystical - I see you back there. hee hee  Nice DOF!!!  Love the flower colors.', '2006-02-01 12:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110380, 288934, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''d crop just agove the leaves and zoom in on her face a bit more.  Nice lighting and smooth skin! 7</td>', 'I''d crop just agove the leaves and zoom in on her face a bit more.  Nice lighting and smooth skin! 7', '2006-02-01 12:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110421, 288631, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not really what I would call romanting but meets the challenge as I am concerned.  Not a bad shot at all, I like that it was taken at an angle and the composition is good.  Not as fond of the lighting though, too harsh for my taste, well actually I just discovered softboxes and am a big sucker for soft lighting as it is so I am a bit tainted so take my comment with a grain of salt.  :)</td>', 'Not really what I would call romanting but meets the challenge as I am concerned.  Not a bad shot at all, I like that it was taken at an angle and the composition is good.  Not as fond of the lighting though, too harsh for my taste, well actually I just discovered softboxes and am a big sucker for soft lighting as it is so I am a bit tainted so take my comment with a grain of salt.  :)', '2006-02-01 12:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110437, 289384, 27482, '<td valign="top">As a person who has seen TONS of flower shots, this one still appeals to me.  Interesting lighting and composition make this shot work.  8 from me.</td>', 'As a person who has seen TONS of flower shots, this one still appeals to me.  Interesting lighting and composition make this shot work.  8 from me.', '2006-02-01 12:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110472, 285840, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice setting but a little uninteresting as it is.  Just an idea, a couple of people dancing a slow dance in the out of focus backround would be pretty fitting with this shot, at least IMHO.  Anyway, technically a well done shot, nice lighting and composition.  6 from me.</td>', 'Nice setting but a little uninteresting as it is.  Just an idea, a couple of people dancing a slow dance in the out of focus backround would be pretty fitting with this shot, at least IMHO.  Anyway, technically a well done shot, nice lighting and composition.  6 from me.', '2006-02-01 12:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110502, 288932, 52495, '<td valign="top">Photography is good but seems to be artificial in novelty</td>', 'Photography is good but seems to be artificial in novelty', '2006-02-01 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110504, 289151, 52495, '<td valign="top">very artificial</td>', 'very artificial', '2006-02-01 12:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110535, 289294, 27482, '<td valign="top">Been done to death so no points for originality.  Frankly this isn´t very well done technically speaking either, the filter itself out of focus, the harsh lighting causing glare on top of it and also some bad glares on the pages towards the upper corners.  Anyway, sorry but for an unoriginal shot that isn´t terribl well done technically I only give a 4.  No offense meant of course.  Also, I encourage you to keep at this, looking at images that have been done to death and then imitating them but then put your own little twist on them, just do something different and funky so don´t let my comment discourage you.</td>', 'Been done to death so no points for originality.  Frankly this isn´t very well done technically speaking either, the filter itself out of focus, the harsh lighting causing glare on top of it and also some bad glares on the pages towards the upper corners.  Anyway, sorry but for an unoriginal shot that isn´t terribl well done technically I only give a 4.  No offense meant of course.  Also, I encourage you to keep at this, looking at images that have been done to death and then imitating them but then put your own little twist on them, just do something different and funky so don´t let my comment discourage you.', '2006-02-01 12:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110544, 288198, 42288, '<td valign="top">I think it would have looked better without the border</td>', 'I think it would have looked better without the border', '2006-02-01 12:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110549, 289166, 42288, '<td valign="top">I think lighting is the main problem here. Composition is good</td>', 'I think lighting is the main problem here. Composition is good', '2006-02-01 12:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110551, 285822, 46045, '<td valign="top">I love it! great mood to this. I like the warm lighting and the motion blur too.</td>', 'I love it! great mood to this. I like the warm lighting and the motion blur too.', '2006-02-01 12:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110556, 289254, 42288, '<td valign="top">Heart of Stone ??  No composition nor lighting Sorry</td>', 'Heart of Stone ??  No composition nor lighting Sorry', '2006-02-01 12:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110561, 287552, 52571, '<td valign="top">These lovebirds are getting to the heart of the matter...very naturally romantic!</td>', 'These lovebirds are getting to the heart of the matter...very naturally romantic!', '2006-02-01 12:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110566, 287827, 42288, '<td valign="top">The main problem IMHO id that the focus is on the purple flower while the glass and yellow flower are out of focus and appear blurred also I think it would have worked out better if you gave it more light and colours</td>', 'The main problem IMHO id that the focus is on the purple flower while the glass and yellow flower are out of focus and appear blurred also I think it would have worked out better if you gave it more light and colours', '2006-02-01 12:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110569, 288765, 52571, '<td valign="top">cute!</td>', 'cute!', '2006-02-01 12:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110571, 288614, 42288, '<td valign="top">First Impression is good but seems to lack something after looking at it for a couple of seconds. Still a good contender</td>', 'First Impression is good but seems to lack something after looking at it for a couple of seconds. Still a good contender', '2006-02-01 12:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110577, 288240, 42288, '<td valign="top">My first impression when I saw it was just one word "WOW" !<br/>Excellent composition, Lighting and the name really fits well.<br/>This will surely place very high !! - 10</td>', 'My first impression when I saw it was just one word "WOW" !Excellent composition, Lighting and the name really fits well.This will surely place very high !! - 10', '2006-02-01 12:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110581, 287453, 42288, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. not too sure about the blue filter tough</td>', 'Very nice shot. not too sure about the blue filter tough', '2006-02-01 12:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110585, 286901, 52571, '<td valign="top">We all wish to find our prince :-)</td>', 'We all wish to find our prince :-)', '2006-02-01 12:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110586, 288687, 42288, '<td valign="top">Nice composition pitty about the blown out sun !!</td>', 'Nice composition pitty about the blown out sun !!', '2006-02-01 12:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
