(2110800, 288934, 41574, '<td valign="top">It seems like to much of a "studio shot" to evoke any feeling; it all looks very "staged" (I''m sure it is, but that doesn''t really make it "work" [at least, not for me]). It''s not a bad image, but it doesn''t really speak to me or anything, either.</td>', 'It seems like to much of a "studio shot" to evoke any feeling; it all looks very "staged" (I''m sure it is, but that doesn''t really make it "work" [at least, not for me]). It''s not a bad image, but it doesn''t really speak to me or anything, either.', '2006-02-01 13:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110808, 288614, 41574, '<td valign="top">I could have done without the yellow background; it just makes an otherwise-sensational subject, get a bit lost. I could get if you weren''t going for "strong contrast," but the "yellow-on-yellow," nevertheless, was a mistake.</td>', 'I could have done without the yellow background; it just makes an otherwise-sensational subject, get a bit lost. I could get if you weren''t going for "strong contrast," but the "yellow-on-yellow," nevertheless, was a mistake.', '2006-02-01 13:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110814, 289183, 41574, '<td valign="top">It''s not romance, and it''s an "OK" shot. It conveys a cool feeling, but the poor "night-lighting" really hurts things. An altered white balanced might have bumped up the score on this.</td>', 'It''s not romance, and it''s an "OK" shot. It conveys a cool feeling, but the poor "night-lighting" really hurts things. An altered white balanced might have bumped up the score on this.', '2006-02-01 13:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
