(2110832, 287539, 41574, '<td valign="top">Awww. I think this might have been more suitable for a "friendship" challenge, but it works OK, here, as well. Very endearing capture; I like it a lot.</td>', 'Awww. I think this might have been more suitable for a "friendship" challenge, but it works OK, here, as well. Very endearing capture; I like it a lot.', '2006-02-01 13:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110840, 286000, 41574, '<td valign="top">The extreme over-exposure does little here but make this picture feel very much like a "snapshot." The composition is commendable, but the shot is not. Furthermore, it conveys more "idle, waiting for a dance to start," than "romance." Perhaps if the subjects'' gazes weren''t fixed on us, the "romantic" angle of the photograph would be more believable.</td>', 'The extreme over-exposure does little here but make this picture feel very much like a "snapshot." The composition is commendable, but the shot is not. Furthermore, it conveys more "idle, waiting for a dance to start," than "romance." Perhaps if the subjects'' gazes weren''t fixed on us, the "romantic" angle of the photograph would be more believable.', '2006-02-01 13:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110877, 286591, 44490, '<td valign="top">Welcome to DPC - image is small, please see the tutorial "Using Photoshop to Prepare Photos for DPC Challenges."  Better lighting would help the levels, so that detail in some areas isn''t so "blown out."  Computer over right shoulder is distracting.  Also read up on "rule of thirds" for less-central and more interesting composition.</td>', 'Welcome to DPC - image is small, please see the tutorial "Using Photoshop to Prepare Photos for DPC Challenges."  Better lighting would help the levels, so that detail in some areas isn''t so "blown out."  Computer over right shoulder is distracting.  Also read up on "rule of thirds" for less-central and more interesting composition.', '2006-02-01 14:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110881, 288126, 44490, '<td valign="top">Looks like a happy couple, but image is too small to see much at all, please read the tutorial "Using Photoshop to Prepare Photos for DPC Challenges."</td>', 'Looks like a happy couple, but image is too small to see much at all, please read the tutorial "Using Photoshop to Prepare Photos for DPC Challenges."', '2006-02-01 14:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
