(2110968, 285822, 44490, '<td valign="top">Looks like you were trying for an interesting effect, but it didn''t work in my humble opinion.  The beautiful setting is sharp with good DOF, but the main subject is too blurred for detail, and the camera tilt doesn''t help.</td>', 'Looks like you were trying for an interesting effect, but it didn''t work in my humble opinion.  The beautiful setting is sharp with good DOF, but the main subject is too blurred for detail, and the camera tilt doesn''t help.', '2006-02-01 14:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
