(2111008, 285960, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but looks like a focus miss, as strands on neck seem to be the sharpest part of the image - were you too close for your camera/lens?  Back up to the minimum focus distance, and crop in software.</td>', 'Nice composition, but looks like a focus miss, as strands on neck seem to be the sharpest part of the image - were you too close for your camera/lens?  Back up to the minimum focus distance, and crop in software.', '2006-02-01 14:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
