(2111091, 288760, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, pose, and reflection, but unfortunately not enough DOF, as neither head is in focus.  If you have focus point selection, try center point only on head, lock and reframe or crop for composition.</td>', 'Nice composition, pose, and reflection, but unfortunately not enough DOF, as neither head is in focus.  If you have focus point selection, try center point only on head, lock and reframe or crop for composition.', '2006-02-01 15:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
