(2111099, 288035, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and composition.  Unfortunately lacks clarity on the diamond, at least as far as we can tell.  Sharper and more DOF would be better.</td>', 'Nice pose and composition.  Unfortunately lacks clarity on the diamond, at least as far as we can tell.  Sharper and more DOF would be better.', '2006-02-01 15:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111112, 289151, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL!!  This is wonderful.  Hurray for your original idea!!!!</td>', 'ROFL!!  This is wonderful.  Hurray for your original idea!!!!', '2006-02-01 15:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111114, 287699, 15711, '<td valign="top">The child with the outstretched arms is great. I love the rich green tone.  Wonder if you couldn''t enrich the blues as well.  Nice compostiion!! 8</td>', 'The child with the outstretched arms is great. I love the rich green tone.  Wonder if you couldn''t enrich the blues as well.  Nice compostiion!! 8', '2006-02-01 15:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111116, 287541, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice pose.  Bigger image would be better, please see the tutorial "Using Photoshop to Prepare Photos for DPC Challenges."  Focus on eyes rather than shoulder would be better.  Foreground clothing is blown out, try cropping and better lighting, not just on camera flash.</td>', 'Nice pose.  Bigger image would be better, please see the tutorial "Using Photoshop to Prepare Photos for DPC Challenges."  Focus on eyes rather than shoulder would be better.  Foreground clothing is blown out, try cropping and better lighting, not just on camera flash.', '2006-02-01 15:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111118, 288051, 15711, '<td valign="top">WONDERFUL!</td>', 'WONDERFUL!', '2006-02-01 15:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111130, 286058, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and sharpness, but overall image is just too dark.  Could be saved by processing for brighter levels with contrast and saturation adjustment to preserve the nice colors.</td>', 'Nice composition and sharpness, but overall image is just too dark.  Could be saved by processing for brighter levels with contrast and saturation adjustment to preserve the nice colors.', '2006-02-01 15:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111136, 287123, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful skin tones.  Might be a bit provocative for some, but I think it''s nicely done.  The blue tone really works.</td>', 'Beautiful skin tones.  Might be a bit provocative for some, but I think it''s nicely done.  The blue tone really works.', '2006-02-01 15:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111142, 287714, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I think I''d crop just below the shoulders.  The hands show the embrace, but you get the idea of that by their closeness and all of the fingers just detract as far as I''m concerned.  I do like thier earnest look of affection.  Good luck!! 7</td>', 'Nice.  I think I''d crop just below the shoulders.  The hands show the embrace, but you get the idea of that by their closeness and all of the fingers just detract as far as I''m concerned.  I do like thier earnest look of affection.  Good luck!! 7', '2006-02-01 15:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111147, 289161, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Focus on face would be better as well as less motion blur.  Try cranking up the ISO.  Also cropping out some of the shutter and a little of the out-of-focus bedsheet rope would be better.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Focus on face would be better as well as less motion blur.  Try cranking up the ISO.  Also cropping out some of the shutter and a little of the out-of-focus bedsheet rope would be better.', '2006-02-01 15:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111150, 287973, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is divine.  So much going on with the great colors of the corner.  This is really cute!!! 9</td>', 'Oh this is divine.  So much going on with the great colors of the corner.  This is really cute!!! 9', '2006-02-01 15:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111163, 289089, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL  TOOOOO FUnny!!!!! 8</td>', 'ROFL  TOOOOO FUnny!!!!! 8', '2006-02-01 15:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111166, 286094, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is great with the oversaturation of color. I like it''s urban sense too. Bumping up - my fav. of the challenge.</td>', 'This is great with the oversaturation of color. I like it''s urban sense too. Bumping up - my fav. of the challenge.', '2006-02-01 15:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111170, 289376, 15711, '<td valign="top">CUTE!!!  Would be a great ad campaign shot. Bumping up. 9</td>', 'CUTE!!!  Would be a great ad campaign shot. Bumping up. 9', '2006-02-01 15:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111203, 289151, 42715, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this!  Great idea.</td>', 'Absolutely love this!  Great idea.', '2006-02-01 15:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111246, 288475, 22379, '<td valign="top">this image is so small i could not even tell it was meant to be a dog for quite some time. To love a dog is one thing, but to have a love affair with onre (ie a romance) is a bit distrubing in my eyes.</td>', 'this image is so small i could not even tell it was meant to be a dog for quite some time. To love a dog is one thing, but to have a love affair with onre (ie a romance) is a bit distrubing in my eyes.', '2006-02-01 15:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111252, 286131, 22379, '<td valign="top">Size really does matter on dpc. You cannot expect voters to be able to jusge the merits of a photo they can barely see. Try for 640pxl at the longest dimension next time.</td>', 'Size really does matter on dpc. You cannot expect voters to be able to jusge the merits of a photo they can barely see. Try for 640pxl at the longest dimension next time.', '2006-02-01 15:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111256, 286266, 22379, '<td valign="top">This pair may be better suited for the abstract challengesince you arehaving trouble getting a still shot of them both.</td>', 'This pair may be better suited for the abstract challengesince you arehaving trouble getting a still shot of them both.', '2006-02-01 15:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111262, 286171, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Couple is partly lost against the background, and there''s too much negative space for my taste.  Would be better if couple were closer and contrasted against the walkway.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Couple is partly lost against the background, and there''s too much negative space for my taste.  Would be better if couple were closer and contrasted against the walkway.', '2006-02-01 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111273, 287090, 22379, '<td valign="top">You are requesting a very far strecth of the viewers imagination by depicting 2 dogs with a stick as a visualisation of romance. <br/>Taking the photo pointing the camera towards the sun has caused the pink and white lense flare, and caused the dark dogs t5o have no details. The various clutters and distractions in the background does not compliment the subjects of the image.</td>', 'You are requesting a very far strecth of the viewers imagination by depicting 2 dogs with a stick as a visualisation of romance. Taking the photo pointing the camera towards the sun has caused the pink and white lense flare, and caused the dark dogs t5o have no details. The various clutters and distractions in the background does not compliment the subjects of the image.', '2006-02-01 16:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111281, 289254, 22379, '<td valign="top">If you are so jaded by romance that you feel your heart is a stone, why put yourself through the misery of entering the challenge?</td>', 'If you are so jaded by romance that you feel your heart is a stone, why put yourself through the misery of entering the challenge?', '2006-02-01 16:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111282, 288819, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice elements of model, cello, and candles, nice composition.  Image is too dark overall, try bringing up the midtone levels in PS.  A little more DOF and more eyes would be better.</td>', 'Nice elements of model, cello, and candles, nice composition.  Image is too dark overall, try bringing up the midtone levels in PS.  A little more DOF and more eyes would be better.', '2006-02-01 16:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111297, 286591, 22379, '<td valign="top">I can see the intentions are good in this image - and in that it is a better depiction of romance than a lot of the more empty images. Unfortunately you have been let down on th technical side. The harsh lighting has caused the hand tobe almost blown out completely, and the lips to have an awkward tinge to them. Always try to enter as large as image as possible, because people deduct points for images of this size.</td>', 'I can see the intentions are good in this image - and in that it is a better depiction of romance than a lot of the more empty images. Unfortunately you have been let down on th technical side. The harsh lighting has caused the hand tobe almost blown out completely, and the lips to have an awkward tinge to them. Always try to enter as large as image as possible, because people deduct points for images of this size.', '2006-02-01 16:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111302, 287541, 22379, '<td valign="top">The colour, lack of focus, lack of detail in her sweater and haloing makes this image appear like a screencapture from a security camera. Strangely voyeuristic.</td>', 'The colour, lack of focus, lack of detail in her sweater and haloing makes this image appear like a screencapture from a security camera. Strangely voyeuristic.', '2006-02-01 16:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111309, 288331, 22379, '<td valign="top">With a shift in focus, this could have pontentially made a very strong abstract image. As it stands, i am finding the focus to be a little off par, making the line of the red petal strange in contrast to the yello petal behind.</td>', 'With a shift in focus, this could have pontentially made a very strong abstract image. As it stands, i am finding the focus to be a little off par, making the line of the red petal strange in contrast to the yello petal behind.', '2006-02-01 16:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111310, 288174, 45790, '<td valign="top">Dress overexposed and lighting is too harsh.</td>', 'Dress overexposed and lighting is too harsh.', '2006-02-01 16:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111313, 288614, 22379, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of the yellow cast, as it seems to be bleeding away details from the rose''s petals.</td>', 'I am not a fan of the yellow cast, as it seems to be bleeding away details from the rose''s petals.', '2006-02-01 16:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111318, 289183, 22379, '<td valign="top">every time i see a picture like this on DPC i hope it is a joke. There is nothing vivually appealing about major camera shake and over exposed streetlights. The angle is the only point of interest in this image.</td>', 'every time i see a picture like this on DPC i hope it is a joke. There is nothing vivually appealing about major camera shake and over exposed streetlights. The angle is the only point of interest in this image.', '2006-02-01 16:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111319, 289389, 45790, '<td valign="top">I''d expect this would be better in color, and certainly with the coke machine and open sign cropped out. Or are you just being ficicious?</td>', 'I''d expect this would be better in color, and certainly with the coke machine and open sign cropped out. Or are you just being ficicious?', '2006-02-01 16:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111321, 288760, 45790, '<td valign="top">Bird facing the camera isn''t in focus.</td>', 'Bird facing the camera isn''t in focus.', '2006-02-01 16:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111322, 285960, 22379, '<td valign="top">I do wish this image had been in focus.</td>', 'I do wish this image had been in focus.', '2006-02-01 16:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111325, 287184, 22379, '<td valign="top">For me this is an uninteresting snap of someones bathroom. There is a lot of clutter, such as the plant right in center that hints at snap rather than a composed image.</td>', 'For me this is an uninteresting snap of someones bathroom. There is a lot of clutter, such as the plant right in center that hints at snap rather than a composed image.', '2006-02-01 16:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111326, 288126, 22379, '<td valign="top">size matters on DPC<br/>try to make the longer dimension of the photo 640pxl for submissions to DPC so you don`t lose points for image size.</td>', 'size matters on DPCtry to make the longer dimension of the photo 640pxl for submissions to DPC so you don`t lose points for image size.', '2006-02-01 16:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111329, 286857, 45790, '<td valign="top">Would prefer if you cropped out stuff on right. That would also put the sun glare off-center instead of a bullseye.</td>', 'Would prefer if you cropped out stuff on right. That would also put the sun glare off-center instead of a bullseye.', '2006-02-01 16:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111343, 286000, 45790, '<td valign="top">Sorry, it''s overexposed.</td>', 'Sorry, it''s overexposed.', '2006-02-01 16:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111353, 289155, 51533, '<td valign="top">??</td>', '??', '2006-02-01 16:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111356, 287592, 52584, '<td valign="top">well done</td>', 'well done', '2006-02-01 16:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111358, 288783, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and composition.  An additional element might help, perhaps a rose, a starfish, a sand dollar, etc.</td>', 'Nice idea and composition.  An additional element might help, perhaps a rose, a starfish, a sand dollar, etc.', '2006-02-01 16:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111363, 287874, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice elements, sharpness, and color.  Larger image and less central composition would be better.</td>', 'Nice elements, sharpness, and color.  Larger image and less central composition would be better.', '2006-02-01 16:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111364, 286901, 51533, '<td valign="top">He looks happy enough! :)</td>', 'He looks happy enough! :)', '2006-02-01 16:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111370, 289089, 19708, '<td valign="top">OMG - I had to restrain myself from a total loss of bladder control!! Linda??<br/>This has to be one of the funniest pictures to ever be displayed on my monitor.<br/>I tried to vote this as a 22 but would only accept a 10.</td>', 'OMG - I had to restrain myself from a total loss of bladder control!! Linda??This has to be one of the funniest pictures to ever be displayed on my monitor.I tried to vote this as a 22 but would only accept a 10.', '2006-02-01 16:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111375, 288945, 45790, '<td valign="top">You got your laugh. Do I really need to comment on this?</td>', 'You got your laugh. Do I really need to comment on this?', '2006-02-01 16:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111381, 289425, 19708, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful.<br/>The tone and saturation are perfect!<br/>A perfect 10 from me - another flower affectionado.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful.The tone and saturation are perfect!A perfect 10 from me - another flower affectionado.', '2006-02-01 16:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111383, 289089, 45790, '<td valign="top">Funny and a great picture as well.</td>', 'Funny and a great picture as well.', '2006-02-01 16:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111387, 286000, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and composition.  Sorry that foreground is blown out and chairs in background are distracting.</td>', 'Nice pose and composition.  Sorry that foreground is blown out and chairs in background are distracting.', '2006-02-01 16:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111396, 287044, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and composition, brighter lighting/levels would be better.</td>', 'Nice idea and composition, brighter lighting/levels would be better.', '2006-02-01 16:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111397, 288152, 45790, '<td valign="top">Flat and not in focus.</td>', 'Flat and not in focus.', '2006-02-01 16:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111416, 286023, 47704, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  I scrolled this pic up and down through the screen and the perspective messed with my eye.  8</td>', 'Very cool.  I scrolled this pic up and down through the screen and the perspective messed with my eye.  8', '2006-02-01 16:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111419, 288780, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, sharpness in foreground, color in background.  But too much of the image is out-of-focus, consider more DOF or composition for less vertical expanse.</td>', 'Nice idea, sharpness in foreground, color in background.  But too much of the image is out-of-focus, consider more DOF or composition for less vertical expanse.', '2006-02-01 16:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111426, 289029, 47704, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this has to do with romance.  I like the pic.  The contrast could be different but the picture has character.</td>', 'Not sure what this has to do with romance.  I like the pic.  The contrast could be different but the picture has character.', '2006-02-01 16:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111428, 287552, 52587, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture :)</td>', 'Beautiful picture :)', '2006-02-01 16:51:18.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2111430, 287762, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice model, and over-the-shoulder angle to tie into challenge.  Focus on eye and more DOF would be better, as the ear dominates not just in location, but in focus.  Consider a plain background to eliminate distractions.</td>', 'Nice model, and over-the-shoulder angle to tie into challenge.  Focus on eye and more DOF would be better, as the ear dominates not just in location, but in focus.  Consider a plain background to eliminate distractions.', '2006-02-01 16:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111432, 289341, 47704, '<td valign="top">What does this have to do with romance?  1</td>', 'What does this have to do with romance?  1', '2006-02-01 16:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111437, 289029, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting expression and lighting.  How about an additional element to tie in the challenge?</td>', 'Interesting expression and lighting.  How about an additional element to tie in the challenge?', '2006-02-01 16:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111438, 287973, 47704, '<td valign="top">Great pic.  I hope this was a candid you shot.  The bicycle without the rear tire adds some great personality to the pic too.  Excellent job.  9</td>', 'Great pic.  I hope this was a candid you shot.  The bicycle without the rear tire adds some great personality to the pic too.  Excellent job.  9', '2006-02-01 16:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111443, 287541, 47704, '<td valign="top">Looks horribly out of focus.  1</td>', 'Looks horribly out of focus.  1', '2006-02-01 16:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111461, 289151, 47704, '<td valign="top">OMG, what an idea!!  I have to say I really don''t like the pic but you shot a good picture and the creativity is great.  8</td>', 'OMG, what an idea!!  I have to say I really don''t like the pic but you shot a good picture and the creativity is great.  8', '2006-02-01 16:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111471, 288833, 47704, '<td valign="top">I really like this pic.  I wish it was an advanced editing challenge though so you could edit out the creases in the sheet.  Great idea though and that little factor won''t affect my judging.  I know you were limited by the rules.  8</td>', 'I really like this pic.  I wish it was an advanced editing challenge though so you could edit out the creases in the sheet.  Great idea though and that little factor won''t affect my judging.  I know you were limited by the rules.  8', '2006-02-01 17:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111475, 286296, 44490, '<td valign="top">Too cute.  While Richard Scarry is great, a "romantic" fairy tale with a prince and princess and outfits would be a better tie to the challenge.  A little less of the book would be better, as it dominates the foreground.</td>', 'Too cute.  While Richard Scarry is great, a "romantic" fairy tale with a prince and princess and outfits would be a better tie to the challenge.  A little less of the book would be better, as it dominates the foreground.', '2006-02-01 17:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111481, 288198, 47704, '<td valign="top">What a neat pic.  Just wondering - did you buy the flowers and let them wilt or did you have them already and see the opportunity?  8</td>', 'What a neat pic.  Just wondering - did you buy the flowers and let them wilt or did you have them already and see the opportunity?  8', '2006-02-01 17:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111484, 289374, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement in tub.  Less clutter would be better, ex., remove the plants, and be careful if that lamp is electric!</td>', 'Nice arrangement in tub.  Less clutter would be better, ex., remove the plants, and be careful if that lamp is electric!', '2006-02-01 17:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111486, 286000, 47704, '<td valign="top">This is a good pic but the boys face looks a little flushed.  Like there''s too much light on it.  I would usually score low for that but you took a great shot.  B&amp;W made the pic too.  Color wouldn''t have expressed the mood/tone.  7</td>', 'This is a good pic but the boys face looks a little flushed.  Like there''s too much light on it.  I would usually score low for that but you took a great shot.  B&W made the pic too.  Color wouldn''t have expressed the mood/tone.  7', '2006-02-01 17:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111495, 288645, 31443, '<td valign="top">Magical alright! Nice to see the sun on their faces..</td>', 'Magical alright! Nice to see the sun on their faces..', '2006-02-01 17:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111502, 288240, 52576, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and good use of DoF.</td>', 'Nice composition and good use of DoF.', '2006-02-01 17:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111505, 287184, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice glowing color.  Fewer elements/less clutter (plants, towels, bottles in background) would be better, and dark foreground elements obscure the center.</td>', 'Nice glowing color.  Fewer elements/less clutter (plants, towels, bottles in background) would be better, and dark foreground elements obscure the center.', '2006-02-01 17:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111510, 287539, 31443, '<td valign="top">This is so incredibly cute!</td>', 'This is so incredibly cute!', '2006-02-01 17:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111522, 287351, 52576, '<td valign="top">Captures the theme nicely.</td>', 'Captures the theme nicely.', '2006-02-01 17:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111545, 288934, 52576, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit.</td>', 'Nicely lit.', '2006-02-01 17:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111550, 288934, 31443, '<td valign="top">Very nice light, looks so natural..</td>', 'Very nice light, looks so natural..', '2006-02-01 17:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111559, 287714, 52576, '<td valign="top">Good light balance</td>', 'Good light balance', '2006-02-01 17:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111566, 285822, 31443, '<td valign="top">In full swing, made me smile..</td>', 'In full swing, made me smile..', '2006-02-01 17:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111570, 287123, 16106, '<td valign="top">Tell me you didn''t dodge the edges here, because the subject is handled tastfully, with just a bit of heat and the lightng is almost perfect (the man''s hair is a bit blocked up) and the composition of the models with strong diagonals pulling the eye through the frame is all so good that this will ribbon. So I hope you did those falling off edges with lighting and no dodging because I''d like to see this with a blue ribbon and not under a pink stripe.</td>', 'Tell me you didn''t dodge the edges here, because the subject is handled tastfully, with just a bit of heat and the lightng is almost perfect (the man''s hair is a bit blocked up) and the composition of the models with strong diagonals pulling the eye through the frame is all so good that this will ribbon. So I hope you did those falling off edges with lighting and no dodging because I''d like to see this with a blue ribbon and not under a pink stripe.', '2006-02-01 17:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111583, 289111, 16106, '<td valign="top">the framing seems too sparse, I realise that you were going for the lost and lonley look, but the image leaves my eye hungry for more. Technically the twig closest to us is a bit blown out and the over all composition might have been helped by darker blacks.</td>', 'the framing seems too sparse, I realise that you were going for the lost and lonley look, but the image leaves my eye hungry for more. Technically the twig closest to us is a bit blown out and the over all composition might have been helped by darker blacks.', '2006-02-01 17:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111588, 289151, 48456, '<td valign="top">hahahahahha!!!! but is that romance or is that lust?</td>', 'hahahahahha!!!! but is that romance or is that lust?', '2006-02-01 17:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111590, 289294, 16106, '<td valign="top">The top of the text is blown and the uppermost part of the filter is outside the focal range. The idea is a classic (i.e. used alot but still good) and I like the clever use of the text and the centerness. Rotated square and with more carefull lighting would have helped a nice image score better</td>', 'The top of the text is blown and the uppermost part of the filter is outside the focal range. The idea is a classic (i.e. used alot but still good) and I like the clever use of the text and the centerness. Rotated square and with more carefull lighting would have helped a nice image score better', '2006-02-01 17:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111591, 288621, 47704, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Took me a second to see that her hand is on his zipper.  Ahhhh, 23 was sooooooo much fun!!!</td>', 'I like it.  Took me a second to see that her hand is on his zipper.  Ahhhh, 23 was sooooooo much fun!!!', '2006-02-01 17:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111592, 288456, 52576, '<td valign="top">Nice detail</td>', 'Nice detail', '2006-02-01 17:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111595, 289042, 52576, '<td valign="top">These are great!</td>', 'These are great!', '2006-02-01 17:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111597, 289180, 16106, '<td valign="top">Silly, but alot of fun. The flash is too harsh to show off the little furball''s fur and it makes ugly reflections in real and glass eyes. That patch of open backround in the upper left seems a waste.</td>', 'Silly, but alot of fun. The flash is too harsh to show off the little furball''s fur and it makes ugly reflections in real and glass eyes. That patch of open backround in the upper left seems a waste.', '2006-02-01 17:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111604, 289425, 52576, '<td valign="top">Very nice crisp detail</td>', 'Very nice crisp detail', '2006-02-01 17:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
