(2111609, 289342, 16106, '<td valign="top">While I dont care for shoehorning flower shots into challenges, the colors here, particularlly the way the blue grey backround sets off red peach, make this work pretty well. Nice DOF and bokhen, but it''s still a stretch</td>', 'While I dont care for shoehorning flower shots into challenges, the colors here, particularlly the way the blue grey backround sets off red peach, make this work pretty well. Nice DOF and bokhen, but it''s still a stretch', '2006-02-01 17:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
