(2112280, 286058, 52536, '<td valign="top">most beautiful romantic picture i have ever seen !</td>', 'most beautiful romantic picture i have ever seen !', '2006-02-01 20:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112283, 287592, 7628, '<td valign="top">The plain, sterile setting really emphasizes the relationship between your subjects.  All those horizontal lines and the people are vertical but their gaze into eachother''s eyes is horizontal too.  Nice tones, good focus, even lighting.  Lovely, one of my favorites for this challenge.</td>', 'The plain, sterile setting really emphasizes the relationship between your subjects.  All those horizontal lines and the people are vertical but their gaze into eachother''s eyes is horizontal too.  Nice tones, good focus, even lighting.  Lovely, one of my favorites for this challenge.', '2006-02-01 20:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112284, 287351, 52536, '<td valign="top">beautiful.</td>', 'beautiful.', '2006-02-01 20:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112287, 288633, 52536, '<td valign="top">really great concept, voting.</td>', 'really great concept, voting.', '2006-02-01 20:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112288, 289384, 7628, '<td valign="top">Luminous while still being intracate.  I like the abstract quality of the shapes the petals make, while still eing very aware of the conceteness of the rose.  There is almost a movement to the shape - a pinwheel turning, unfurling - which is a fine way to portray romance. Very lovely.</td>', 'Luminous while still being intracate.  I like the abstract quality of the shapes the petals make, while still eing very aware of the conceteness of the rose.  There is almost a movement to the shape - a pinwheel turning, unfurling - which is a fine way to portray romance. Very lovely.', '2006-02-01 20:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112294, 289174, 52536, '<td valign="top">spendid !</td>', 'spendid !', '2006-02-01 20:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112298, 287973, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the business of this scene - it is full of colors and everyday objects - but they all look somehow more special in the light of the central (on the 3rds line!) subjects who stand out in black with the umbrella - as if to help us see how much more beautiful the world looks when you are in love.  All the horizontal and vertical lines frame the subjects well too - this picture is a delightful eyeful!</td>', 'I like the business of this scene - it is full of colors and everyday objects - but they all look somehow more special in the light of the central (on the 3rds line!) subjects who stand out in black with the umbrella - as if to help us see how much more beautiful the world looks when you are in love.  All the horizontal and vertical lines frame the subjects well too - this picture is a delightful eyeful!', '2006-02-01 20:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112311, 287762, 7628, '<td valign="top">The softness of this photo is very romantic.  Her gaze looks full of daydreams - she is in another world.  The light on her hair is a bright and real contrast with her mood - it is sharp and real and glowing. I like the balance.  Good use of DOF to isolate the subject from the background.  I like the color as well.</td>', 'The softness of this photo is very romantic.  Her gaze looks full of daydreams - she is in another world.  The light on her hair is a bright and real contrast with her mood - it is sharp and real and glowing. I like the balance.  Good use of DOF to isolate the subject from the background.  I like the color as well.', '2006-02-01 20:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112339, 289174, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very clean and even - I like the pristine feeling - fresh new love.  The lighting is very even, perhaps a little bland in that it does not define the textures here distinctly - but it does give a soft effect.  I think I might like to see a bit more contrast.  Also all that empty space in the upper right corner is a little distracting - having the hand come down from there might fill the space better.  Nice focus.</td>', 'Very clean and even - I like the pristine feeling - fresh new love.  The lighting is very even, perhaps a little bland in that it does not define the textures here distinctly - but it does give a soft effect.  I think I might like to see a bit more contrast.  Also all that empty space in the upper right corner is a little distracting - having the hand come down from there might fill the space better.  Nice focus.', '2006-02-01 20:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112348, 286901, 7628, '<td valign="top">Funny!  the curtain of hair works as a lovely backdrop for the toad.  The earings are a very nice touch - fanciful - and help definr the line of her jaw and almost draw your eyes more to her puckering lips.  Wish the toad was coming out of the bottom left corner more and not floating into the fram from the left - looks a little zero-G.  The light is lovely and golden (beautiful hair!) very fairy-tale romance.</td>', 'Funny!  the curtain of hair works as a lovely backdrop for the toad.  The earings are a very nice touch - fanciful - and help definr the line of her jaw and almost draw your eyes more to her puckering lips.  Wish the toad was coming out of the bottom left corner more and not floating into the fram from the left - looks a little zero-G.  The light is lovely and golden (beautiful hair!) very fairy-tale romance.', '2006-02-01 21:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112361, 287552, 7628, '<td valign="top">What a lovely pair - and a perfect pose!  I like how your composition includes the reflections - I might crop some more at the top to emphasize the reflections and also because there is nothing there that adds to the image.  The light on the birds is bright and seems a little blown out in places on the wings - losing some detail.  But the shape of the birds and their relationship to eachother are a more important factor in this picture than detail.</td>', 'What a lovely pair - and a perfect pose!  I like how your composition includes the reflections - I might crop some more at the top to emphasize the reflections and also because there is nothing there that adds to the image.  The light on the birds is bright and seems a little blown out in places on the wings - losing some detail.  But the shape of the birds and their relationship to eachother are a more important factor in this picture than detail.', '2006-02-01 21:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112369, 288633, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like all the empty space - it is the visual equivalent of a question - the fingers line up nicely on a diagonal that emphasizes the ring and leads the eyeeither to it or away from it perhaps depending on the answer to the question.  I am not sure what the brown object the hand is resting on is - it distracts my eye and does not add to the picture.  Nice use of shallow DOF and nice focus. Wish the shadow falling on the finger below the ring might have been reduced by another light or a bounce.</td>', 'I like all the empty space - it is the visual equivalent of a question - the fingers line up nicely on a diagonal that emphasizes the ring and leads the eyeeither to it or away from it perhaps depending on the answer to the question.  I am not sure what the brown object the hand is resting on is - it distracts my eye and does not add to the picture.  Nice use of shallow DOF and nice focus. Wish the shadow falling on the finger below the ring might have been reduced by another light or a bounce.', '2006-02-01 21:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112375, 289424, 7628, '<td valign="top">Sweet, clear, nice tones deep and dark to bright and light.  Great focus and detail.  Nice background and good dof use.  A very wholesome photo that gives a wholesome feeling to this relationship - warm and strong.  I like the angled composition - adds a bit of that whirl love gives you and creates a dynamic for your eye to follow.  Excellent.</td>', 'Sweet, clear, nice tones deep and dark to bright and light.  Great focus and detail.  Nice background and good dof use.  A very wholesome photo that gives a wholesome feeling to this relationship - warm and strong.  I like the angled composition - adds a bit of that whirl love gives you and creates a dynamic for your eye to follow.  Excellent.', '2006-02-01 21:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112482, 289384, 51974, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF</td>', 'Nice use of DOF', '2006-02-01 21:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112534, 286094, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good capture and composition.  Bold colors.  Criticism; not much, the colors, while not my ''personal preference'' in general with these color combinations, work very well here, especially to complement the coloring in the main subjects, especially the girl''s hair.  The whole scene/''set'', like the colors, has a certain ''hard'' feel, but again, I think this works very well in this shot and makes it.  Hard to tell if this needs a nudge rotation up on the left or not, or whether the ground/surface is just a bit ''uneven'', but minor.  A more finely tuned crop, especially on the bottom/bottom left corner, may have refined this just a bit more.  The overexposed areas and the sun/lighting, again, adds to this overall and makes for a fairly unique shot, in my opinion.  Perhaps a little sharper, not sure.</td>', '8 - Good capture and composition.  Bold colors.  Criticism; not much, the colors, while not my ''personal preference'' in general with these color combinations, work very well here, especially to complement the coloring in the main subjects, especially the girl''s hair.  The whole scene/''set'', like the colors, has a certain ''hard'' feel, but again, I think this works very well in this shot and makes it.  Hard to tell if this needs a nudge rotation up on the left or not, or whether the ground/surface is just a bit ''uneven'', but minor.  A more finely tuned crop, especially on the bottom/bottom left corner, may have refined this just a bit more.  The overexposed areas and the sun/lighting, again, adds to this overall and makes for a fairly unique shot, in my opinion.  Perhaps a little sharper, not sure.', '2006-02-01 21:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112539, 289294, 45790, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea. A bit overexposed and needs additional DOF so ring is in focus.</td>', 'Excellent idea. A bit overexposed and needs additional DOF so ring is in focus.', '2006-02-01 21:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112584, 287388, 25270, '<td valign="top">Nice Composition--a lot of work went into the preparation!  Lacks a litte "Spark" but overall very nice</td>', 'Nice Composition--a lot of work went into the preparation!  Lacks a litte "Spark" but overall very nice', '2006-02-01 22:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112591, 289422, 25270, '<td valign="top">Very aptly titled!  Nice Lighting really sets the mood.</td>', 'Very aptly titled!  Nice Lighting really sets the mood.', '2006-02-01 22:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112602, 286591, 45790, '<td valign="top">Overexposed, too small (use the full 640 pixels allowed)</td>', 'Overexposed, too small (use the full 640 pixels allowed)', '2006-02-01 22:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112614, 289348, 45790, '<td valign="top">Poor Alfred died in 1908, but his wife isn''t beside her, but is presumably dead after 135 years. You probably should have picked another tombstone, but I think it is a good idea and the desaturation of all but the red (flower) is touching.</td>', 'Poor Alfred died in 1908, but his wife isn''t beside her, but is presumably dead after 135 years. You probably should have picked another tombstone, but I think it is a good idea and the desaturation of all but the red (flower) is touching.', '2006-02-01 22:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112632, 286094, 52591, '<td valign="top">Excellent moment, love the background!</td>', 'Excellent moment, love the background!', '2006-02-01 22:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112642, 287268, 30861, '<td valign="top">IMO you have destroyed a fascinating image with this heavy-handed border. I''m not wild about the color shift either. I look past all that and just look at these very strange relationships between bird &amp; people and go "wow".</td>', 'IMO you have destroyed a fascinating image with this heavy-handed border. I''m not wild about the color shift either. I look past all that and just look at these very strange relationships between bird & people and go "wow".', '2006-02-01 22:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112645, 288716, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice expression.  seems a bit soft and muted.  most likely an extremely difficult shot with the long shutter.  perhaps even a bit too long as the candle is a bit over exposed</td>', 'nice expression.  seems a bit soft and muted.  most likely an extremely difficult shot with the long shutter.  perhaps even a bit too long as the candle is a bit over exposed', '2006-02-01 22:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112651, 286901, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love how bloated the frog is. He looks like he really does have a prince inside!</td>', 'I love how bloated the frog is. He looks like he really does have a prince inside!', '2006-02-01 22:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112653, 289151, 52591, '<td valign="top">Such a creative take on the concept....</td>', 'Such a creative take on the concept....', '2006-02-01 22:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112660, 289294, 52591, '<td valign="top">Really creative...love it.</td>', 'Really creative...love it.', '2006-02-01 22:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112661, 286921, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice idea.  like how you laid the laces to not make the heart too obvious.  perhaps a duotone conversion to red could have strengthened your cause for the voters.</td>', 'nice idea.  like how you laid the laces to not make the heart too obvious.  perhaps a duotone conversion to red could have strengthened your cause for the voters.', '2006-02-01 22:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112664, 288945, 52591, '<td valign="top">Seems a little off topic...nice shot, though.</td>', 'Seems a little off topic...nice shot, though.', '2006-02-01 22:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112669, 286857, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting...but fairly hard to look at.  perhaps it was just that "love is blinding"</td>', 'interesting...but fairly hard to look at.  perhaps it was just that "love is blinding"', '2006-02-01 22:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112670, 285902, 52591, '<td valign="top">Very nice framing.</td>', 'Very nice framing.', '2006-02-01 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112698, 288317, 52591, '<td valign="top">Love the shot, especially the freckles.  Would have voted higher...but I''m not sure how on-topic it is.</td>', 'Love the shot, especially the freckles.  Would have voted higher...but I''m not sure how on-topic it is.', '2006-02-01 22:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112707, 287001, 13688, '<td valign="top">like the soft dreamlike effect, but the contrast seems almost too high.  my eyes are having trouble focusing on something.  I wish the eyes and heart didn''t compete so much for my interest.  Perhaps I''d like this more if the crop was tighter on one of them.</td>', 'like the soft dreamlike effect, but the contrast seems almost too high.  my eyes are having trouble focusing on something.  I wish the eyes and heart didn''t compete so much for my interest.  Perhaps I''d like this more if the crop was tighter on one of them.', '2006-02-01 22:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112735, 289258, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice idea.  seems a bit unintentionally grainy and soft.  would be really cool if we could see that steam a little better...but I know how hard that is to do.  i really like that light source on the right which is balanced quite well in the reflections.  The cork on it''s current angle seems awkward and doesn''t help the composition for me.</td>', 'nice idea.  seems a bit unintentionally grainy and soft.  would be really cool if we could see that steam a little better...but I know how hard that is to do.  i really like that light source on the right which is balanced quite well in the reflections.  The cork on it''s current angle seems awkward and doesn''t help the composition for me.', '2006-02-01 22:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112742, 289294, 52605, '<td valign="top">very very creative i''d say takes an eye to see this beautiful thing</td>', 'very very creative i''d say takes an eye to see this beautiful thing', '2006-02-01 22:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112746, 288596, 13688, '<td valign="top">cute kid with cute expression...i think i looked a bit too long and noticed his nostrils</td>', 'cute kid with cute expression...i think i looked a bit too long and noticed his nostrils', '2006-02-01 22:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112755, 287074, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice composition.  would have really liked to see this with a little less exposure</td>', 'nice composition.  would have really liked to see this with a little less exposure', '2006-02-01 22:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112853, 286094, 13688, '<td valign="top">like the colors.  I see this doing well...funny thing is, he seems really quite indifferent to her advances...not exactly romantic.  But, I think your image is the perfect commentary on how men and women view romance differently, even more so with younger men.</td>', 'like the colors.  I see this doing well...funny thing is, he seems really quite indifferent to her advances...not exactly romantic.  But, I think your image is the perfect commentary on how men and women view romance differently, even more so with younger men.', '2006-02-01 22:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112899, 288051, 13688, '<td valign="top">great idea.  the sky is obviously quite dramatic.  i would have liked the silhouettes true black or with a bit more detail.  he seems hesitant to her advance.  Not sure if this was your original intent, but it adds a strange air of tension to the pic, that I don''t believe suits it.  that said...don''t listen to me I''m sitting at a low 4 and this should do well.</td>', 'great idea.  the sky is obviously quite dramatic.  i would have liked the silhouettes true black or with a bit more detail.  he seems hesitant to her advance.  Not sure if this was your original intent, but it adds a strange air of tension to the pic, that I don''t believe suits it.  that said...don''t listen to me I''m sitting at a low 4 and this should do well.', '2006-02-01 22:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112937, 285960, 13688, '<td valign="top">very sensual, kind of like "The Kiss" closeup.  i wish this wasn''t so soft, and had a bit more contrast to give it a bit more edge.</td>', 'very sensual, kind of like "The Kiss" closeup.  i wish this wasn''t so soft, and had a bit more contrast to give it a bit more edge.', '2006-02-01 23:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
