(2113374, 286131, 31403, '<td valign="top">dark upper half of photo, dog red-eye, bright reflection from on-board flash on the leather - very small size compared with the 640 pixel allowed - make this a snapshot in my book.<br/> <br/>Suggestions:<br/> <br/>Drape a sheet over the couch<br/>wait for daylight and open the curtains to let nice diffuse light in<br/>shoot from another 18 inches to 3 feet up<br/> <br/>Hope you find this helpful, as was intended.</td>', 'dark upper half of photo, dog red-eye, bright reflection from on-board flash on the leather - very small size compared with the 640 pixel allowed - make this a snapshot in my book. Suggestions: Drape a sheet over the couchwait for daylight and open the curtains to let nice diffuse light inshoot from another 18 inches to 3 feet up Hope you find this helpful, as was intended.', '2006-02-02 01:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
