(2114212, 289166, 5792, '<td valign="top">Any use of Berringer''s White Zinfadel for holding lacy underwear works for me. :) Composition and content are fine. The candle is overexposed and there is digital "banding" around it which is hard to avoid.</td>', 'Any use of Berringer''s White Zinfadel for holding lacy underwear works for me. :) Composition and content are fine. The candle is overexposed and there is digital "banding" around it which is hard to avoid.', '2006-02-02 10:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
