(2114721, 287552, 44490, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture, position, reflection, angle.  Too bad parts of the birds are blown out, so it''s difficult to see detail and verify sharpness.  Cropping out the top and right would be better.  The position of the necks and wings still carries this image.</td>', 'Beautiful capture, position, reflection, angle.  Too bad parts of the birds are blown out, so it''s difficult to see detail and verify sharpness.  Cropping out the top and right would be better.  The position of the necks and wings still carries this image.', '2006-02-02 13:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114723, 288609, 51533, '<td valign="top">I was set back at first by the fact that is a "sunset shot", but on second inspection I liked it better; it is actually a nice sunset, carefully framed composition, and has two romantic looking people in it :)</td>', 'I was set back at first by the fact that is a "sunset shot", but on second inspection I liked it better; it is actually a nice sunset, carefully framed composition, and has two romantic looking people in it :)', '2006-02-02 13:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114724, 287699, 50635, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I like the lighting contrast between the foreground and the sky, and how the green of the grass is muted: it allows the eye to take in other characteristics of the photo such as the shapes, shading, the neat outlines of the tree branches.  Very beautiful blue in the sky--you avoided a cheesy hue.  My only ''complaint'' would be that the person looks kind of like a scarecrow, and I''m not sure you want that effect.  Nice work.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I like the lighting contrast between the foreground and the sky, and how the green of the grass is muted: it allows the eye to take in other characteristics of the photo such as the shapes, shading, the neat outlines of the tree branches.  Very beautiful blue in the sky--you avoided a cheesy hue.  My only ''complaint'' would be that the person looks kind of like a scarecrow, and I''m not sure you want that effect.  Nice work.', '2006-02-02 13:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114730, 286296, 51533, '<td valign="top">I try not to be sidetracked by images with cute kids :)</td>', 'I try not to be sidetracked by images with cute kids :)', '2006-02-02 13:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
