(2115286, 286767, 45790, '<td valign="top">uncommented (#1)<br/>Sorry I couldn''t resist. But I like your picture. Good storytelling. Sharp and good B&amp;W conversion.</td>', 'uncommented (#1)Sorry I couldn''t resist. But I like your picture. Good storytelling. Sharp and good B&W conversion.', '2006-02-02 16:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115342, 288687, 52667, '<td valign="top">i think the setting is beautiful.</td>', 'i think the setting is beautiful.', '2006-02-02 16:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115382, 288475, 10858, '<td valign="top">To small photo and doesn''t meet the challenge IMO.</td>', 'To small photo and doesn''t meet the challenge IMO.', '2006-02-02 17:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115387, 286591, 10858, '<td valign="top">The quality of this photo is quite bad, it''s also small. Lighting is the most improtant issue to improve here, it''s too harsch.</td>', 'The quality of this photo is quite bad, it''s also small. Lighting is the most improtant issue to improve here, it''s too harsch.', '2006-02-02 17:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115390, 286131, 10858, '<td valign="top">Too small shot, sorry. And the way the small dog was flashed on the eye... Don''t use direct flash for animal photos, it hurts their eyes.</td>', 'Too small shot, sorry. And the way the small dog was flashed on the eye... Don''t use direct flash for animal photos, it hurts their eyes.', '2006-02-02 17:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115395, 289254, 10858, '<td valign="top">A bit out of focus, the composition seems to be conceptless. A heart-shaped stone would work better here, because the photo has to live without the title, too.</td>', 'A bit out of focus, the composition seems to be conceptless. A heart-shaped stone would work better here, because the photo has to live without the title, too.', '2006-02-02 17:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115408, 289183, 10858, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see the concept of the tilting here, neither the dizzy style. Sometimes it works but here it''s too much IMO, and also overexposed. I can''t really catch romance, it would be better to see your model''s expression on the face, and using a tripod would also help you hold your camera stable.</td>', 'I don''t really see the concept of the tilting here, neither the dizzy style. Sometimes it works but here it''s too much IMO, and also overexposed. I can''t really catch romance, it would be better to see your model''s expression on the face, and using a tripod would also help you hold your camera stable.', '2006-02-02 17:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115415, 288126, 10858, '<td valign="top">Why did you upload it so small? This could have been a nice snapshot, but overexposed on the whites, due to the flash, I guess. The background is distracting, too. When taking wedding shots, one of the most important technical issues is to have a correct exposure for whites. Therefore, lighting is very important.</td>', 'Why did you upload it so small? This could have been a nice snapshot, but overexposed on the whites, due to the flash, I guess. The background is distracting, too. When taking wedding shots, one of the most important technical issues is to have a correct exposure for whites. Therefore, lighting is very important.', '2006-02-02 17:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115427, 288676, 25655, '<td valign="top">This is so sweet and naive... <br/>The worm tones work great for this one, and I just love those expresions. Something so adult in their faces, but also so young.<br/> <br/>I wish there wasn''t that tree in the background though. just a plain white background would do better IMO.<br/>however, I''m afraid this is not the mob''s cup-of-tea. It takes more then a split of second to look into this photo, and see it''s depth. <br/>People here don''t have this time anymore... <br/>Still, from me you get a 10. This one is so much more touching then dozens of kisses.</td>', 'This is so sweet and naive... The worm tones work great for this one, and I just love those expresions. Something so adult in their faces, but also so young. I wish there wasn''t that tree in the background though. just a plain white background would do better IMO.however, I''m afraid this is not the mob''s cup-of-tea. It takes more then a split of second to look into this photo, and see it''s depth. People here don''t have this time anymore... Still, from me you get a 10. This one is so much more touching then dozens of kisses.', '2006-02-02 17:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115431, 287388, 10858, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, it''s very nice. though, focus seems to be unclear and the background spoils the idea. There are too many reflections on the chocolate, and the plate is greyish instead of white. Keep the strawberry with the heart shaped choc inside, the green leaves, and put it on a single white backfround. Lighting could be improved, too, reflecting objects are more difficult to lighten well. I would take a non-reflecting white cardboard instead with lots of diffused lights to get clear colours, a sharp subject and a homogenic, neutral background. (4)</td>', 'I like the idea here, it''s very nice. though, focus seems to be unclear and the background spoils the idea. There are too many reflections on the chocolate, and the plate is greyish instead of white. Keep the strawberry with the heart shaped choc inside, the green leaves, and put it on a single white backfround. Lighting could be improved, too, reflecting objects are more difficult to lighten well. I would take a non-reflecting white cardboard instead with lots of diffused lights to get clear colours, a sharp subject and a homogenic, neutral background. (4)', '2006-02-02 17:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115437, 285822, 25655, '<td valign="top">I love the idea. <br/>Too bad your photo is tilting right. Feels like they are ust about to fall. 7</td>', 'I love the idea. Too bad your photo is tilting right. Feels like they are ust about to fall. 7', '2006-02-02 17:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115478, 288073, 26756, '<td valign="top">This is edgy, artistic and excellent work but you''ll probably get killed by voters who see this as well outside the norm of "romance".  I like the partially hidden face, pose, and idea.  For a different audience this would do well but maybe not here. I like it though.</td>', 'This is edgy, artistic and excellent work but you''ll probably get killed by voters who see this as well outside the norm of "romance".  I like the partially hidden face, pose, and idea.  For a different audience this would do well but maybe not here. I like it though.', '2006-02-02 17:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115511, 287268, 49737, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if I care for the border, but it is definitely a great capture.</td>', 'I''m not sure if I care for the border, but it is definitely a great capture.', '2006-02-02 18:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115616, 288475, 49737, '<td valign="top">Image is small, looks like it might be a little soft or out of focus, but hard to tell with the resolution.  I would have liked to see it larger, it looks like a cute scene.</td>', 'Image is small, looks like it might be a little soft or out of focus, but hard to tell with the resolution.  I would have liked to see it larger, it looks like a cute scene.', '2006-02-02 18:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115622, 286266, 49737, '<td valign="top">Focus is off.  Lens too slow?</td>', 'Focus is off.  Lens too slow?', '2006-02-02 18:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115654, 288716, 49737, '<td valign="top">Sharper focus on the eyes would be better.  I wonder if underexposing a little bit more would help, I''m finding myself drawn too much to the candle at the moment.  Beautiful image though, and wonderful emotion.</td>', 'Sharper focus on the eyes would be better.  I wonder if underexposing a little bit more would help, I''m finding myself drawn too much to the candle at the moment.  Beautiful image though, and wonderful emotion.', '2006-02-02 18:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115745, 289422, 5664, '<td valign="top">Better to have lighter background .. ice</td>', 'Better to have lighter background .. ice', '2006-02-02 19:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115908, 288979, 29748, '<td valign="top">very beautiful flowers</td>', 'very beautiful flowers', '2006-02-02 20:29:06.000000', NULL, 1);
