(2115918, 288609, 29748, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, This is the epitome of romance.  The sunset is gorgeous, and the setting is perfect.</td>', 'Beautiful, This is the epitome of romance.  The sunset is gorgeous, and the setting is perfect.', '2006-02-02 20:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
