(2116260, 287552, 38648, '<td valign="top">OK, how did you get them to do that? 8</td>', 'OK, how did you get them to do that? 8', '2006-02-02 22:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116270, 288833, 17072, '<td valign="top">I hate to say this but I think this shot would be much better with a different model.</td>', 'I hate to say this but I think this shot would be much better with a different model.', '2006-02-02 22:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116281, 289294, 51185, '<td valign="top">this is amazing... absolutley amazing. How did you get the ring to make the heart? wow.. im so amazed...&lt;3</td>', 'this is amazing... absolutley amazing. How did you get the ring to make the heart? wow.. im so amazed...<3', '2006-02-02 22:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116299, 286266, 38648, '<td valign="top">OK, I give up. What is it?</td>', 'OK, I give up. What is it?', '2006-02-02 22:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116305, 289254, 38648, '<td valign="top">O K</td>', 'O K', '2006-02-02 22:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116307, 289348, 17072, '<td valign="top">She prob''ly got remarried and is buried with the 2nd husband. :)  Nice pic, though.</td>', 'She prob''ly got remarried and is buried with the 2nd husband. :)  Nice pic, though.', '2006-02-02 22:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116311, 289341, 17072, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this fits with the challenge</td>', 'Not sure how this fits with the challenge', '2006-02-02 22:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116312, 289089, 38648, '<td valign="top">you made me laugh out loud.</td>', 'you made me laugh out loud.', '2006-02-02 22:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116313, 286171, 17072, '<td valign="top">how sweet</td>', 'how sweet', '2006-02-02 22:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116366, 288876, 10261, '<td valign="top">The lighting looks a little flat. Boosting the contrast would have helped this image a lot. Adding a light from behind to separate them from the backdrop a little would have also been a nice touch.</td>', 'The lighting looks a little flat. Boosting the contrast would have helped this image a lot. Adding a light from behind to separate them from the backdrop a little would have also been a nice touch.', '2006-02-02 22:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116370, 288765, 45849, '<td valign="top">This is adorable! Very creative. :)</td>', 'This is adorable! Very creative. :)', '2006-02-02 23:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116372, 289166, 10261, '<td valign="top">The light is a little flat and the colors are rather subdued. If you were going for a softer look, softer focus would have helped to further emphasize the theme.</td>', 'The light is a little flat and the colors are rather subdued. If you were going for a softer look, softer focus would have helped to further emphasize the theme.', '2006-02-02 23:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116378, 288614, 45849, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful capture.</td>', 'This is a beautiful capture.', '2006-02-02 23:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116395, 286058, 10261, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any clear connection between the silhouettes of the people and the gulls, nor any connection to the challenge topic. The exposure is good, I just can''t see what you''re trying to communicate here.</td>', 'I don''t see any clear connection between the silhouettes of the people and the gulls, nor any connection to the challenge topic. The exposure is good, I just can''t see what you''re trying to communicate here.', '2006-02-02 23:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116408, 287539, 10261, '<td valign="top">Even if I were to believe that this image conveys "love", since the challenge topic was romance, this would still fail to qualify.<br/> <br/>The color palate used in the image is interesting. I imagine that this is roughly what it looked like in person, but playing with the white balance might produce a more pleasing result. Shooting this with a shallower DoF and getting rid of the green trash can in the background (either by recomposing or cropping it out) would have improved the image.</td>', 'Even if I were to believe that this image conveys "love", since the challenge topic was romance, this would still fail to qualify. The color palate used in the image is interesting. I imagine that this is roughly what it looked like in person, but playing with the white balance might produce a more pleasing result. Shooting this with a shallower DoF and getting rid of the green trash can in the background (either by recomposing or cropping it out) would have improved the image.', '2006-02-02 23:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116418, 289260, 10261, '<td valign="top">The odd placement and intensity of the light make this feel far too staged to work.</td>', 'The odd placement and intensity of the light make this feel far too staged to work.', '2006-02-02 23:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116440, 289183, 10261, '<td valign="top">Did you even _try_ to relate this image to the challenge topic? The word "alone" in the title is about as close as this seems to get. Even if the subject matter were dead on target this style of image probably wouldn''t score too well here at DPC. You typically have to demonstrate that you know the rules before you can break them well; in a learning environment like this rule breaking tends to receive low marks even if done well.<br/> <br/>That said, I find the image somewhat intriguing. If you''d have taken it from closer to the ground and given the figure some more head room I think that this would look better. The intersection and the lights provide a strong sense of perspective; this element could be used to great advantage. The bottom right of the image seems to be filled with purposeless dead space; give it a purpose or crop it out.</td>', 'Did you even _try_ to relate this image to the challenge topic? The word "alone" in the title is about as close as this seems to get. Even if the subject matter were dead on target this style of image probably wouldn''t score too well here at DPC. You typically have to demonstrate that you know the rules before you can break them well; in a learning environment like this rule breaking tends to receive low marks even if done well. That said, I find the image somewhat intriguing. If you''d have taken it from closer to the ground and given the figure some more head room I think that this would look better. The intersection and the lights provide a strong sense of perspective; this element could be used to great advantage. The bottom right of the image seems to be filled with purposeless dead space; give it a purpose or crop it out.', '2006-02-02 23:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116443, 288299, 10261, '<td valign="top">It looks like you over-sharpened this to make up for poor focus in the original.</td>', 'It looks like you over-sharpened this to make up for poor focus in the original.', '2006-02-02 23:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116453, 286971, 10261, '<td valign="top">The fisheye feel of this image is distracting and seems to compete too much with the intended subject. A shallower DoF would have helped to drop a lot of the clutter out of the background.</td>', 'The fisheye feel of this image is distracting and seems to compete too much with the intended subject. A shallower DoF would have helped to drop a lot of the clutter out of the background.', '2006-02-02 23:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116483, 289425, 10261, '<td valign="top">This flower is well shot; the beads of water are a nice touch. Boosting the saturation of the green somewhat would probably have complemented the color of the flower. I would have preferred to see the DoF centered a little better; it seems like it''s on the dew drops in the center of the frame, which is one of the less interesting portions of the flower. On most cameras you can press the shutter button down half-way to get the focus to lock, then re-compose to move that area to some uncentered location. Flower shots are so common that they tend to fare rather poorly with the voters; good luck on this one.</td>', 'This flower is well shot; the beads of water are a nice touch. Boosting the saturation of the green somewhat would probably have complemented the color of the flower. I would have preferred to see the DoF centered a little better; it seems like it''s on the dew drops in the center of the frame, which is one of the less interesting portions of the flower. On most cameras you can press the shutter button down half-way to get the focus to lock, then re-compose to move that area to some uncentered location. Flower shots are so common that they tend to fare rather poorly with the voters; good luck on this one.', '2006-02-02 23:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116495, 285902, 41574, '<td valign="top">Not much saves this picture from being anything but a "snapshot." The content is acceptable for this challenge, but the execution doesn''t offer anything.</td>', 'Not much saves this picture from being anything but a "snapshot." The content is acceptable for this challenge, but the execution doesn''t offer anything.', '2006-02-02 23:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116502, 288073, 41574, '<td valign="top">It really doesn''t indicate any degree of romance to me (except, perhaps, in some undeniably perfunctory, "artsy" way), but naked women never warrant a "1" from me.</td>', 'It really doesn''t indicate any degree of romance to me (except, perhaps, in some undeniably perfunctory, "artsy" way), but naked women never warrant a "1" from me.', '2006-02-02 23:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116505, 287409, 10261, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t feel like much effort was spent on this image. If you had found an interesting angle to shoot this from or done something noteworthy with the DoF I''d be more inclined to like it. As it is, this just feels like a quick snapshot. Adding some artifact of human presence would help to create a more personal connection to the viewer. As currently composed it feels about as personal as an ATM wishing me a nice day.</td>', 'It doesn''t feel like much effort was spent on this image. If you had found an interesting angle to shoot this from or done something noteworthy with the DoF I''d be more inclined to like it. As it is, this just feels like a quick snapshot. Adding some artifact of human presence would help to create a more personal connection to the viewer. As currently composed it feels about as personal as an ATM wishing me a nice day.', '2006-02-02 23:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116513, 288126, 41574, '<td valign="top">A very small, very "snapshot" picture. For both reasons, it''s really hard to judge: images that are tiny are difficult to find deatils in. "Snapshots" are simply not the types of "photographs" that these challenges tend to be about. The content of your shot is appropriate, but your picture is nothing beyond what you''d expect to find in a photo album.</td>', 'A very small, very "snapshot" picture. For both reasons, it''s really hard to judge: images that are tiny are difficult to find deatils in. "Snapshots" are simply not the types of "photographs" that these challenges tend to be about. The content of your shot is appropriate, but your picture is nothing beyond what you''d expect to find in a photo album.', '2006-02-02 23:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116514, 288819, 10261, '<td valign="top">The setup appears to have had a lot of thought put into it, but the girl looks too self-conscious to let this image feel as intimate as it might have. Adding a soft, diffused light behind the model would have helped to separate her from the background.</td>', 'The setup appears to have had a lot of thought put into it, but the girl looks too self-conscious to let this image feel as intimate as it might have. Adding a soft, diffused light behind the model would have helped to separate her from the background.', '2006-02-02 23:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116518, 288475, 41574, '<td valign="top">Too small to be accurately judged. Also, the focus is off.</td>', 'Too small to be accurately judged. Also, the focus is off.', '2006-02-02 23:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116519, 286901, 10261, '<td valign="top">The earrings are very distracting</td>', 'The earrings are very distracting', '2006-02-02 23:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116520, 289089, 41574, '<td valign="top">Adorable; I love it.</td>', 'Adorable; I love it.', '2006-02-02 23:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116527, 289425, 41574, '<td valign="top">Isn''t "pink" for "friendship" or something? A red rose might have been nicer, but, regardless, this is a great photograph. The drops of water work very well, making the shot extraordinarily interesting. Excellent work.</td>', 'Isn''t "pink" for "friendship" or something? A red rose might have been nicer, but, regardless, this is a great photograph. The drops of water work very well, making the shot extraordinarily interesting. Excellent work.', '2006-02-02 23:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116528, 287453, 11960, '<td valign="top">The angles of her left hand is really worrying me...</td>', 'The angles of her left hand is really worrying me...', '2006-02-02 23:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116532, 287714, 41574, '<td valign="top">I love the clarity in this image; the poses, also, work well. Really, it, to me, is not something beyond what I''d expect to see adorned atop the mantle, but, that doesn''t mean that it''s not appreciable. Good job.</td>', 'I love the clarity in this image; the poses, also, work well. Really, it, to me, is not something beyond what I''d expect to see adorned atop the mantle, but, that doesn''t mean that it''s not appreciable. Good job.', '2006-02-02 23:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116533, 287714, 10261, '<td valign="top">Based on the comfort that these two show with one another I wouldn''t doubt that they''re romantically involved, but the image seems to convey a feeling of affection rather than overt romance.</td>', 'Based on the comfort that these two show with one another I wouldn''t doubt that they''re romantically involved, but the image seems to convey a feeling of affection rather than overt romance.', '2006-02-02 23:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116536, 289294, 50466, '<td valign="top">gee, thats never been done before.....<br/> <br/> <br/>still a good shot though</td>', 'gee, thats never been done before.....  still a good shot though', '2006-02-02 23:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116542, 286591, 41574, '<td valign="top">I like the "hand-over-heart" pose, but the photograph does not belong in this challenge; it looks as though it was taken at work with a camera-phone. Sorry if this is harsh.</td>', 'I like the "hand-over-heart" pose, but the photograph does not belong in this challenge; it looks as though it was taken at work with a camera-phone. Sorry if this is harsh.', '2006-02-02 23:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116544, 289374, 50466, '<td valign="top">you must have spent some serious time setting this one up</td>', 'you must have spent some serious time setting this one up', '2006-02-02 23:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116546, 287592, 41574, '<td valign="top">Great, great shot. I love the composition, and I love the title (it''s very fitting).</td>', 'Great, great shot. I love the composition, and I love the title (it''s very fitting).', '2006-02-02 23:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116548, 289425, 50466, '<td valign="top">the cliche of cliches....but, its perfectly executed. 9 from me</td>', 'the cliche of cliches....but, its perfectly executed. 9 from me', '2006-02-02 23:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116552, 288676, 41574, '<td valign="top">Awww...cute. I like it.</td>', 'Awww...cute. I like it.', '2006-02-02 23:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116553, 287268, 10261, '<td valign="top">I strongly dislike the border. Since the people are the intended subject, cropping out some of the larger birds from the top right would probably have improved the image. There even appears to be a convenient horizontal section free of birds that you could have used as a cropping point.</td>', 'I strongly dislike the border. Since the people are the intended subject, cropping out some of the larger birds from the top right would probably have improved the image. There even appears to be a convenient horizontal section free of birds that you could have used as a cropping point.', '2006-02-02 23:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116563, 288642, 10261, '<td valign="top">The expression on the model''s face seems rather emotionally vacant, which detracts from an otherwise well done image. A catchlight in the girl''s eyes might have been an improvement.</td>', 'The expression on the model''s face seems rather emotionally vacant, which detracts from an otherwise well done image. A catchlight in the girl''s eyes might have been an improvement.', '2006-02-02 23:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116575, 288934, 11960, '<td valign="top">Thank God someone actually used a RED rose. I like this shot.</td>', 'Thank God someone actually used a RED rose. I like this shot.', '2006-02-02 23:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116581, 286171, 11960, '<td valign="top">My favorite of this challenge. One of the few shots that I feel acutally meets the challenge. Good Job. 10.</td>', 'My favorite of this challenge. One of the few shots that I feel acutally meets the challenge. Good Job. 10.', '2006-02-02 23:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116593, 288609, 11960, '<td valign="top">In my top 5. Great shot; only nitpick would be to darken up the shadows to a full silluhete.... Again, just a minor thing. It''s a great shot...</td>', 'In my top 5. Great shot; only nitpick would be to darken up the shadows to a full silluhete.... Again, just a minor thing. It''s a great shot...', '2006-02-02 23:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116639, 289348, 45928, '<td valign="top">Nice use of selective desaturation. This usually comes out badly but it fits well here. Nice dop, too.</td>', 'Nice use of selective desaturation. This usually comes out badly but it fits well here. Nice dop, too.', '2006-02-03 00:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
