(2116716, 289174, 10261, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W is often used to highlight the textures in an image, but you appear to have used NeatImage or something similar to scrub all of the detail off. I think that this would have been a stronger entry by either leaving it in color or not using NI on a B&amp;W image. The position of the hands is well done. Somehow the background feels too empty; some nice bokeh might have added a little kick to the visual impact.</td>', 'B&W is often used to highlight the textures in an image, but you appear to have used NeatImage or something similar to scrub all of the detail off. I think that this would have been a stronger entry by either leaving it in color or not using NI on a B&W image. The position of the hands is well done. Somehow the background feels too empty; some nice bokeh might have added a little kick to the visual impact.', '2006-02-03 00:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116722, 288051, 45928, '<td valign="top">Absolutley beautiful. This is a great shot. Fantastic colors and concept.</td>', 'Absolutley beautiful. This is a great shot. Fantastic colors and concept.', '2006-02-03 00:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116727, 286094, 45928, '<td valign="top">Great colors, a very romantic scene. The angle of the shot is great, too.</td>', 'Great colors, a very romantic scene. The angle of the shot is great, too.', '2006-02-03 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
