(2117173, 285822, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot, I both love and hate the motion blur.  I definately think there should be some, but it´s that their faces are so blurred that I hate.  If you somehow had been able to freeze the faces more and had some more motion elsewhere, like on the legs like they were dancing it would really have hit the spot with me but I like this and the thought behind it.  Gave it a 7.</td>', 'Pretty cool shot, I both love and hate the motion blur.  I definately think there should be some, but it´s that their faces are so blurred that I hate.  If you somehow had been able to freeze the faces more and had some more motion elsewhere, like on the legs like they were dancing it would really have hit the spot with me but I like this and the thought behind it.  Gave it a 7.', '2006-02-03 05:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117175, 289258, 27482, '<td valign="top">Too bad the noise levels are so excessive on this image or it would have been a good product shot, that and some better lighting too.  Anyway, cool touch that you added the smoke.</td>', 'Too bad the noise levels are so excessive on this image or it would have been a good product shot, that and some better lighting too.  Anyway, cool touch that you added the smoke.', '2006-02-03 05:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117178, 288760, 27482, '<td valign="top">Would just be soo much better if the focus was on their heads and the butt of the closer goose...</td>', 'Would just be soo much better if the focus was on their heads and the butt of the closer goose...', '2006-02-03 05:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117179, 289361, 27482, '<td valign="top">I wonder if he would take off up into the air if she let go, thats a LOT of baloons :)  Anyway, a nice street candid, too bad the sky isn´t really interesting as for me it kindof detracts form the shot but nice work, it got a 7 from me.</td>', 'I wonder if he would take off up into the air if she let go, thats a LOT of baloons :)  Anyway, a nice street candid, too bad the sky isn´t really interesting as for me it kindof detracts form the shot but nice work, it got a 7 from me.', '2006-02-03 05:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117183, 288126, 27482, '<td valign="top">Tell them congratulations on their wedding, may they live happily ever after.  If you want a better score though, I would suggest uploading a bigger image next, I find that the closer you get to 640 pixles, the better an image scores.</td>', 'Tell them congratulations on their wedding, may they live happily ever after.  If you want a better score though, I would suggest uploading a bigger image next, I find that the closer you get to 640 pixles, the better an image scores.', '2006-02-03 05:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117189, 286400, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty good image but nothing I haven´t seen before and just soo much better and when I compare this shot to shots like this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=178033" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/340/thumb/178033.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/340/thumb/178033.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/340/thumb/178033.jpg"/></a> it just almost pales in the comparison.  Still a nice shot though, don´t get me wrong and one of the better in the challenge, I gave it a nice score.</td>', 'Pretty good image but nothing I haven´t seen before and just soo much better and when I compare this shot to shots like this  it just almost pales in the comparison.  Still a nice shot though, don´t get me wrong and one of the better in the challenge, I gave it a nice score.', '2006-02-03 05:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117192, 287801, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, got a 7 from me.  Could see this as a postcard but it just needs some expression from the zebra that is being "kissed".  Anyway, nice work.</td>', 'Cute shot, got a 7 from me.  Could see this as a postcard but it just needs some expression from the zebra that is being "kissed".  Anyway, nice work.', '2006-02-03 05:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117193, 288286, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad, like the flames but what this image is severly lacking in my opinion is someones face, it just doesn´t strike a cord with me as it is.  Still like it though and better than most shots in the challenge, gave it a 6.</td>', 'Not bad, like the flames but what this image is severly lacking in my opinion is someones face, it just doesn´t strike a cord with me as it is.  Still like it though and better than most shots in the challenge, gave it a 6.', '2006-02-03 05:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117194, 288317, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice work, I like most things about this shot.  The black backround isn´t winning me over though, this would just look so much cooler if there was a "forest" that was out of focus behind her.  Anyway, one of the better shots in the challenge, got a 7 from me.</td>', 'Nice work, I like most things about this shot.  The black backround isn´t winning me over though, this would just look so much cooler if there was a "forest" that was out of focus behind her.  Anyway, one of the better shots in the challenge, got a 7 from me.', '2006-02-03 05:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117195, 287044, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad but a bit flat, try running this through photoshop once more and use auto curves, I tried it and it just looks soooooo "punchier" and clear.  Anyway, congrats on what I presume is your baby to come, hope it´s healthy :D</td>', 'Not bad but a bit flat, try running this through photoshop once more and use auto curves, I tried it and it just looks soooooo "punchier" and clear.  Anyway, congrats on what I presume is your baby to come, hope it´s healthy :D', '2006-02-03 05:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117196, 289183, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry, a little bit too artsy for me, the motion blur isn´t winning me over.  I think I would have liked the composition though if the whole shot was crystal clear with the person walking in a slight motion blur.</td>', 'Sorry, a little bit too artsy for me, the motion blur isn´t winning me over.  I think I would have liked the composition though if the whole shot was crystal clear with the person walking in a slight motion blur.', '2006-02-03 05:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117198, 287714, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cute shot of a cute couple, got a 6 from me.  Well done on the technicals but needs something extra to get a higher rating from me.</td>', 'Cute shot of a cute couple, got a 6 from me.  Well done on the technicals but needs something extra to get a higher rating from me.', '2006-02-03 05:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117199, 288174, 27482, '<td valign="top">A hard subject to photograph, the dress is just severely blown out but other than that, it´s allright.</td>', 'A hard subject to photograph, the dress is just severely blown out but other than that, it´s allright.', '2006-02-03 06:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117202, 289197, 27482, '<td valign="top">The black backround isn´t scoring any points with me, just think this would have looked soo much cooler with an out of focus church or something.  Other than that, a pretty good job, nice job on the lighting and I like the composition and DOF.</td>', 'The black backround isn´t scoring any points with me, just think this would have looked soo much cooler with an out of focus church or something.  Other than that, a pretty good job, nice job on the lighting and I like the composition and DOF.', '2006-02-03 06:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117205, 287123, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice work.  I especially like the lighting on her face, very nice but not at all as fond of the lighting on his back, not mysterious and dramatic as on her face.  Anyway, one of the better shots in the challenge, got a 7 from me.</td>', 'Nice work.  I especially like the lighting on her face, very nice but not at all as fond of the lighting on his back, not mysterious and dramatic as on her face.  Anyway, one of the better shots in the challenge, got a 7 from me.', '2006-02-03 06:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117206, 287453, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, maybe a tad too contrasty for my taste and I dislike how the lighting is affecting her right hand, looks like she only has 3 fingers.  Anyway, one of the better shots in the challenge, I like that you made it B/W, got a 7 from me.</td>', 'Nice, maybe a tad too contrasty for my taste and I dislike how the lighting is affecting her right hand, looks like she only has 3 fingers.  Anyway, one of the better shots in the challenge, I like that you made it B/W, got a 7 from me.', '2006-02-03 06:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117211, 286792, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice work with the lighting, looks pretty professional.  Not as keen of the greenish colour cast of this image and there seems to be some banding on the vase so image quality could be better.  Anyway, enough for a 6 from me :)</td>', 'Nice work with the lighting, looks pretty professional.  Not as keen of the greenish colour cast of this image and there seems to be some banding on the vase so image quality could be better.  Anyway, enough for a 6 from me :)', '2006-02-03 06:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117213, 288607, 27482, '<td valign="top">Girl looks oddly familiar somehow, you submitted a shot of her before?  Sorry but this shot isn´t really scoring high with me, the pose looks uncomfortable, the black backround isn´t terribly appealing to me in this particular shot and the way it´s composed, the arm and the shoulder draw my attention, not her face.  Still not BAD though so I gave it a 5.</td>', 'Girl looks oddly familiar somehow, you submitted a shot of her before?  Sorry but this shot isn´t really scoring high with me, the pose looks uncomfortable, the black backround isn´t terribly appealing to me in this particular shot and the way it´s composed, the arm and the shoulder draw my attention, not her face.  Still not BAD though so I gave it a 5.', '2006-02-03 06:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117215, 286583, 27482, '<td valign="top">Tell them congrats from me :)</td>', 'Tell them congrats from me :)', '2006-02-03 06:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117218, 287001, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I have never been a fan of soft focus low contrast shots and this is no exception, I just simply do not like the outcome.  Just figured I owed you an explanation as to why I only gave it a 4.</td>', 'Sorry but I have never been a fan of soft focus low contrast shots and this is no exception, I just simply do not like the outcome.  Just figured I owed you an explanation as to why I only gave it a 4.', '2006-02-03 06:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117222, 287268, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry, just had to comment on the frame, just what were you thinking?  Almost ruins a perfectly good shot?  Anyway, pretty hard to look past it so I don´t know if my vote is objectionate or not...</td>', 'Sorry, just had to comment on the frame, just what were you thinking?  Almost ruins a perfectly good shot?  Anyway, pretty hard to look past it so I don´t know if my vote is objectionate or not...', '2006-02-03 06:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117224, 289089, 27482, '<td valign="top">Haha, cute expressions on both of them :)</td>', 'Haha, cute expressions on both of them :)', '2006-02-03 06:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117227, 286171, 27482, '<td valign="top">Love the composition of this shot, great catch!  7 from me.</td>', 'Love the composition of this shot, great catch!  7 from me.', '2006-02-03 06:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117228, 288780, 27482, '<td valign="top">Normally love shallow DOF but here it does not appeal to me, I am pretty sure I would have liked this heaps more if the whole shot were in focus, I am just sitting here squinting my eyes trying to make out that couple.  Nice job on the lighting though :)</td>', 'Normally love shallow DOF but here it does not appeal to me, I am pretty sure I would have liked this heaps more if the whole shot were in focus, I am just sitting here squinting my eyes trying to make out that couple.  Nice job on the lighting though :)', '2006-02-03 06:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117255, 289151, 10858, '<td valign="top">Funny one. :-) Sweet idea, I also like the backfround blown out and the composition. I didn''t know tootbrushing was such an erotic activity, I will do it more often. :-)</td>', 'Funny one. :-) Sweet idea, I also like the backfround blown out and the composition. I didn''t know tootbrushing was such an erotic activity, I will do it more often. :-)', '2006-02-03 06:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117262, 288740, 10858, '<td valign="top">I love the honest expression on her face, which reminds me to a mood of "tears of happiness", cheering up after a quarrel, which is a really great feeling. The writing on her hand reminds me to those days when I rote boys'' names in the corners of my books, or also on my hand, because I thought it would bring me luck with the guy. Good luck!</td>', 'I love the honest expression on her face, which reminds me to a mood of "tears of happiness", cheering up after a quarrel, which is a really great feeling. The writing on her hand reminds me to those days when I rote boys'' names in the corners of my books, or also on my hand, because I thought it would bring me luck with the guy. Good luck!', '2006-02-03 06:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117265, 287592, 10858, '<td valign="top">Use of negative spaces is one of my favourite techniques and it works very well here. Expressive shot, and I feel romance between them, it''s right on their faces. B and W is a great choice. Good luck!</td>', 'Use of negative spaces is one of my favourite techniques and it works very well here. Expressive shot, and I feel romance between them, it''s right on their faces. B and W is a great choice. Good luck!', '2006-02-03 06:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117396, 289361, 27991, '<td valign="top">This photo brings feeling of begining love... before life gets in the way. Nice job 10</td>', 'This photo brings feeling of begining love... before life gets in the way. Nice job 10', '2006-02-03 08:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117397, 288073, 27991, '<td valign="top">Thats romance? sad.</td>', 'Thats romance? sad.', '2006-02-03 08:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117484, 288612, 11960, '<td valign="top">I think I would have shot a bit more of the stem here. As well as either move the flower off-center, or use a square crop. Yellow flowers are symbolic of friendship.</td>', 'I think I would have shot a bit more of the stem here. As well as either move the flower off-center, or use a square crop. Yellow flowers are symbolic of friendship.', '2006-02-03 09:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117489, 289183, 11960, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t evoke a feeling of romance. Lone desperation perhaps...</td>', 'This doesn''t evoke a feeling of romance. Lone desperation perhaps...', '2006-02-03 09:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
