(2118100, 288051, 30049, '<td valign="top">Staged or not, I love this image!  Obviously, the background sunset could stand on it''s own, but compositionally, the addition of the children works wonderfully.  I like the low horizon in the way this was framed also.  I hope people don''t think you oversaturated the sky, because I''ve seen skies like this straight out of the camera.  Bumping this to a 10.</td>', 'Staged or not, I love this image!  Obviously, the background sunset could stand on it''s own, but compositionally, the addition of the children works wonderfully.  I like the low horizon in the way this was framed also.  I hope people don''t think you oversaturated the sky, because I''ve seen skies like this straight out of the camera.  Bumping this to a 10.', '2006-02-03 11:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
