(2119846, 285822, 41522, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  The setting is great, the motion is great.  The embrace is still very evident.  I don''t even mind the tilt in the photo.  But I have to ask ... why oh why didn''tyou set up th shot away from the metal object/man hole cover.  That thing is so distracting for me that it was the first thing I saw and continues to be the thing that draws my attention away from the couple.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  The setting is great, the motion is great.  The embrace is still very evident.  I don''t even mind the tilt in the photo.  But I have to ask ... why oh why didn''tyou set up th shot away from the metal object/man hole cover.  That thing is so distracting for me that it was the first thing I saw and continues to be the thing that draws my attention away from the couple.', '2006-02-03 20:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119863, 286131, 41522, '<td valign="top">It looks like you might have a ouple of cute pups there, but the ize of the image makes it very diffiult to rate properly.  I can say that the refection in the eyes is a bit disappointing.</td>', 'It looks like you might have a ouple of cute pups there, but the ize of the image makes it very diffiult to rate properly.  I can say that the refection in the eyes is a bit disappointing.', '2006-02-03 20:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
