(2119912, 287044, 41522, '<td valign="top">These are always nice shots and great memories for the parents.  I would haveliked a little better lighting for the shot.  This particular shot looks a little flat to me.  JMO.</td>', 'These are always nice shots and great memories for the parents.  I would haveliked a little better lighting for the shot.  This particular shot looks a little flat to me.  JMO.', '2006-02-03 20:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
