(2119941, 286901, 41522, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea behind this.  I wish a little bit more care would have been taken on keeping the stray hairs under control.  I find them to be a bit of a drawback.  JMO</td>', 'I really like the idea behind this.  I wish a little bit more care would have been taken on keeping the stray hairs under control.  I find them to be a bit of a drawback.  JMO', '2006-02-03 20:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119942, 287552, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very pretty! Great shot of the moment, with their wings up that way and the reflections in the water. But the photo is a little overexposed. Can always underexpose a tad so the highlights aren''t blown. I know it ain''t easy when the subject is white and rest of the scene pretty dark.</td>', 'Very pretty! Great shot of the moment, with their wings up that way and the reflections in the water. But the photo is a little overexposed. Can always underexpose a tad so the highlights aren''t blown. I know it ain''t easy when the subject is white and rest of the scene pretty dark.', '2006-02-03 20:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119948, 287388, 29011, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The lighting is somewhat flat and would''ve been nicer if the chocolate on the plate wasn''t so all over the place, in shape of another heart would''ve been cool :)</td>', 'Nice idea. The lighting is somewhat flat and would''ve been nicer if the chocolate on the plate wasn''t so all over the place, in shape of another heart would''ve been cool :)', '2006-02-03 20:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
