(2121876, 288876, 29748, '<td valign="top">sweet and lovable.</td>', 'sweet and lovable.', '2006-02-04 17:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121914, 289384, 10858, '<td valign="top">Good idea to fill the frame. Though, I would have chosen a lower angle to avoid centeration of the rose and get a more interesting viewpoint. I am not sure about the focusing and also seems overexposed - you loose colour on a few petals. Try to get as sharp results as possible, later you can post-process it to have a milder look. Using more diffused lights would result in better exposure than a harsh lighting.</td>', 'Good idea to fill the frame. Though, I would have chosen a lower angle to avoid centeration of the rose and get a more interesting viewpoint. I am not sure about the focusing and also seems overexposed - you loose colour on a few petals. Try to get as sharp results as possible, later you can post-process it to have a milder look. Using more diffused lights would result in better exposure than a harsh lighting.', '2006-02-04 17:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121931, 288198, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice one, looks like dried grounds. Composition and colours touched me, lighting is good, too. I think I woul dtry a bit of sharpening here, sometimes resizing causes the loose of a few details. The only thing that I can''t take here is the border. It''s awful and kills the soft subject. A one-pixel grey and approx. 10 pixels black would fit better IMO.</td>', 'Nice one, looks like dried grounds. Composition and colours touched me, lighting is good, too. I think I woul dtry a bit of sharpening here, sometimes resizing causes the loose of a few details. The only thing that I can''t take here is the border. It''s awful and kills the soft subject. A one-pixel grey and approx. 10 pixels black would fit better IMO.', '2006-02-04 17:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121942, 285840, 10858, '<td valign="top">I love the creative use of DOF here, and the lighting. Looking further than the dining table, guessing makes me curious. I would have removed the left glass from the composition, I see only the edge but IMO it would be better w/o it. Just personal stuff, but I would place the flowers a little bit more to the right and the salt-holder little bit more to the left, so the glass would cover no more than the half of each. Just an idea.</td>', 'I love the creative use of DOF here, and the lighting. Looking further than the dining table, guessing makes me curious. I would have removed the left glass from the composition, I see only the edge but IMO it would be better w/o it. Just personal stuff, but I would place the flowers a little bit more to the right and the salt-holder little bit more to the left, so the glass would cover no more than the half of each. Just an idea.', '2006-02-04 17:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121945, 287552, 52770, '<td valign="top">Lovely pic!!</td>', 'Lovely pic!!', '2006-02-04 17:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121949, 289425, 10858, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture! Though I am not a fan of flowers with waterdrops and I prefer romance with people, I simply like this one. The DOF, the colours, all the composition and the lighting is very moody.</td>', 'Excellent capture! Though I am not a fan of flowers with waterdrops and I prefer romance with people, I simply like this one. The DOF, the colours, all the composition and the lighting is very moody.', '2006-02-04 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121966, 288607, 10858, '<td valign="top">I feel disappointment and impatience in her look. And both at the same time. I like the posing, maybe skin tones look a little bit unnatural, mostly on her arm. May be because of the lighting, not sure, but I guess a light-tone foundation would also help. The green chair, her purple dress and her redish.blond hair look good together, it was a great choice.</td>', 'I feel disappointment and impatience in her look. And both at the same time. I like the posing, maybe skin tones look a little bit unnatural, mostly on her arm. May be because of the lighting, not sure, but I guess a light-tone foundation would also help. The green chair, her purple dress and her redish.blond hair look good together, it was a great choice.', '2006-02-04 17:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121973, 288833, 10858, '<td valign="top">The shadown and the wrap of the background is a little bit distracting, and I suggest using some foundation in order to make her veins less visible on the feet. I like the composition and the colours, blacks, whites and reds work very well for this subject.</td>', 'The shadown and the wrap of the background is a little bit distracting, and I suggest using some foundation in order to make her veins less visible on the feet. I like the composition and the colours, blacks, whites and reds work very well for this subject.', '2006-02-04 17:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
