(2121990, 288621, 10858, '<td valign="top">I love the expressions on the faces - the girl has a really flirty look and the boy is really impressed of her - and the way that the girl is sharp and the box a bit OOF. I would use a more homogenic background for them, or, I would make it more blur out. You have really talented models, I would try some studio shots with the same expressions, playing around, BW would work well, too. There is so much in this photo, it deserves more than a snapshot.</td>', 'I love the expressions on the faces - the girl has a really flirty look and the boy is really impressed of her - and the way that the girl is sharp and the box a bit OOF. I would use a more homogenic background for them, or, I would make it more blur out. You have really talented models, I would try some studio shots with the same expressions, playing around, BW would work well, too. There is so much in this photo, it deserves more than a snapshot.', '2006-02-04 17:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2122007, 287123, 10858, '<td valign="top">I simply go crazy for this shot, not only because it''s excellent, but because it makes me FEEL what I think of romance. The girl''s expression tells me everything, and somehow, the whole mood is very tender and noble.</td>', 'I simply go crazy for this shot, not only because it''s excellent, but because it makes me FEEL what I think of romance. The girl''s expression tells me everything, and somehow, the whole mood is very tender and noble.', '2006-02-04 18:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
