(2123734, 286971, 47852, '<td valign="top">What a fun and real moment you captured here.  I love the expressions of all of the people.  Nicely done!</td>', 'What a fun and real moment you captured here.  I love the expressions of all of the people.  Nicely done!', '2006-02-05 09:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
