(2123742, 288299, 47852, '<td valign="top">When I look at this shot, I don''t associate it with romance.  The flowers are droopy and just don''t make a great subject.  It does have some good color to it though.</td>', 'When I look at this shot, I don''t associate it with romance.  The flowers are droopy and just don''t make a great subject.  It does have some good color to it though.', '2006-02-05 09:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123744, 286266, 47852, '<td valign="top">I can see what you were going for here, but the shot is too blurry and the lighting is poor.  Perhaps taking a few more shots you could have gotten one a little bit clearer.</td>', 'I can see what you were going for here, but the shot is too blurry and the lighting is poor.  Perhaps taking a few more shots you could have gotten one a little bit clearer.', '2006-02-05 09:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123746, 286296, 43565, '<td valign="top">This does not say romance to me.  Maybe if they were adults with candlelight and the rain outside the window...</td>', 'This does not say romance to me.  Maybe if they were adults with candlelight and the rain outside the window...', '2006-02-05 09:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123749, 288945, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like the trees and the colors, but the poles just aren''t romantic to me.</td>', 'I like the trees and the colors, but the poles just aren''t romantic to me.', '2006-02-05 09:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123757, 288073, 43565, '<td valign="top">I think we must have different definitions of romance.</td>', 'I think we must have different definitions of romance.', '2006-02-05 09:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123767, 287123, 43565, '<td valign="top">This is a step or two after the romance stage.</td>', 'This is a step or two after the romance stage.', '2006-02-05 09:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123777, 286131, 43565, '<td valign="top">This does not say romance to me.  As a photo, this looks too much like a snapshot.  Try to include all of the dog''s face.  Also, there is a tutorial on how to resize images, it is easier to see a larger image.</td>', 'This does not say romance to me.  As a photo, this looks too much like a snapshot.  Try to include all of the dog''s face.  Also, there is a tutorial on how to resize images, it is easier to see a larger image.', '2006-02-05 09:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123787, 288475, 43565, '<td valign="top">Try to resize to 640 (there is a tutorial on how to do this).  I find the lights and shadows distracting, and this does not say romance to me.</td>', 'Try to resize to 640 (there is a tutorial on how to do this).  I find the lights and shadows distracting, and this does not say romance to me.', '2006-02-05 09:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123821, 289361, 43565, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this with the couple and the balloons in color and the rest in b&amp;W.  (Maybe not possible in a basic challenge!)  I think this would help separate the couple from the background.  Good idea, though.</td>', 'I would like to see this with the couple and the balloons in color and the rest in b&W.  (Maybe not possible in a basic challenge!)  I think this would help separate the couple from the background.  Good idea, though.', '2006-02-05 10:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
