(2123946, 288035, 11960, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a DeBeers commercial. I like the tone and slightly grainy feel. I gave it a 9. Would have been a 10 for me with slightly more forward DoF. Excellent, excellent job, however!</td>', 'Reminds me of a DeBeers commercial. I like the tone and slightly grainy feel. I gave it a 9. Would have been a 10 for me with slightly more forward DoF. Excellent, excellent job, however!', '2006-02-05 11:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123957, 288051, 11960, '<td valign="top">This is the only image in this challenge that has kids in is that I liked. I''m a sucker for silhouettes. =] The sky is beautiful! There''s such a broad range of tone and color in the sky, and you''ve managed to capture all of it with very little overexposure. 9.</td>', 'This is the only image in this challenge that has kids in is that I liked. I''m a sucker for silhouettes. =] The sky is beautiful! There''s such a broad range of tone and color in the sky, and you''ve managed to capture all of it with very little overexposure. 9.', '2006-02-05 11:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123964, 289424, 11960, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. I''m not tottaly sure why... I like the tint and the blurred background. The lighting is excellent, and unlike 95% of this challenge, this image actually says ''romance'' to me. Good Job! 9.</td>', 'I really like this shot. I''m not tottaly sure why... I like the tint and the blurred background. The lighting is excellent, and unlike 95% of this challenge, this image actually says ''romance'' to me. Good Job! 9.', '2006-02-05 11:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123978, 287592, 11960, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this shot. The horizontal lines contrasted with the vertical bodies. A couple just happy to be together... The tint is great. I only had one nitpick. She doesn''t seem to have any hands. It''s a minor detail that I didn''t even notice till my thrid time through, but now it bugs me... =] All in all a great shot. 8</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this shot. The horizontal lines contrasted with the vertical bodies. A couple just happy to be together... The tint is great. I only had one nitpick. She doesn''t seem to have any hands. It''s a minor detail that I didn''t even notice till my thrid time through, but now it bugs me... =] All in all a great shot. 8', '2006-02-05 11:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123979, 289111, 11960, '<td valign="top">Seems antithetical of the challenge, but I liked the image. I''m hoping this was a red rose. =] 7.</td>', 'Seems antithetical of the challenge, but I liked the image. I''m hoping this was a red rose. =] 7.', '2006-02-05 11:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123984, 288633, 11960, '<td valign="top">To me, this speaks more of love than it does to romance, but it''s a very well executed shot.</td>', 'To me, this speaks more of love than it does to romance, but it''s a very well executed shot.', '2006-02-05 11:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2124046, 288621, 41574, '<td valign="top">More "psychotic stalker" than "romance."</td>', 'More "psychotic stalker" than "romance."', '2006-02-05 12:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2124047, 289197, 41574, '<td valign="top">I''m a bit tired of seeing all the pitch-black backgrounds, on DPChallenge; I wish people would try more to use "natural environment" backdrops, and try less to exploit the "studio style." That said, I think this is a good shot, and that it succeeds in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m a bit tired of seeing all the pitch-black backgrounds, on DPChallenge; I wish people would try more to use "natural environment" backdrops, and try less to exploit the "studio style." That said, I think this is a good shot, and that it succeeds in this challenge.', '2006-02-05 12:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2124230, 288051, 5236, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!!</td>', 'Awesome shot!!', '2006-02-05 14:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2124233, 286400, 5236, '<td valign="top">A little bit of horizon would have added depth.Great shot!!</td>', 'A little bit of horizon would have added depth.Great shot!!', '2006-02-05 14:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
