(2124734, 289376, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like this idea.  I would try levels or curves to see if I could get the background completely white.  It might bring out more details of the candy wrapper, too.  (Or maybe not, I''m not that experienced yet!)  I also think having the candy off center would add more interest.</td>', 'I like this idea.  I would try levels or curves to see if I could get the background completely white.  It might bring out more details of the candy wrapper, too.  (Or maybe not, I''m not that experienced yet!)  I also think having the candy off center would add more interest.', '2006-02-05 20:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
