(2129248, 288488, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed, the big tree coming over the top third of the image works well.<br/>Unfortunately, the background takes the eye away from the subjects, especially the more distant tree..if you could have managed a very shallow depth of field to blur the background or a slightly different viewpoint, it would have worked much better for me.<br/>Bang on for challenge topic though.</td>', 'Nicely framed, the big tree coming over the top third of the image works well.Unfortunately, the background takes the eye away from the subjects, especially the more distant tree..if you could have managed a very shallow depth of field to blur the background or a slightly different viewpoint, it would have worked much better for me.Bang on for challenge topic though.', '2006-02-07 08:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
