(2129295, 287351, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the way the bridge and the railings lead the viewer to the couple.  The concept here is clever.  Something doesn''t feel right.  I think it''s the lighting.  Kind of like you were a little late for the last light of day, or too early to get a good full silhouette.  I hope I''m describing my thoughts on this in an understandable manner...if not, I apologize for being long-winded.  ;^)<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the way the bridge and the railings lead the viewer to the couple.  The concept here is clever.  Something doesn''t feel right.  I think it''s the lighting.  Kind of like you were a little late for the last light of day, or too early to get a good full silhouette.  I hope I''m describing my thoughts on this in an understandable manner...if not, I apologize for being long-winded.  ;^) Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-02-07 09:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
