(2130738, 287184, 25678, '<td valign="top">A little more contrast would be nice, and this is a touch to noisy for my taste</td>', 'A little more contrast would be nice, and this is a touch to noisy for my taste', '2006-02-07 19:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130747, 285840, 25678, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, but I''m not a fan of the set up.  The glass in the foreground I find distracting with it''s placement.  It is intersecting the flowers and pepper mill in an odd way.  Maybe moving the glass to one side and filling with wine?  Then you get to drink the wine after :)</td>', 'I like this idea, but I''m not a fan of the set up.  The glass in the foreground I find distracting with it''s placement.  It is intersecting the flowers and pepper mill in an odd way.  Maybe moving the glass to one side and filling with wine?  Then you get to drink the wine after :)', '2006-02-07 19:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130750, 288633, 51255, '<td valign="top">I like the blank background, it emphasises the focus on the ring, and points out that, at that moment, nothing really matters apart from what the ring symbolises, which is of course invisible ...in that respect I think you''ve taken a photo of romance itself rather well.</td>', 'I like the blank background, it emphasises the focus on the ring, and points out that, at that moment, nothing really matters apart from what the ring symbolises, which is of course invisible ...in that respect I think you''ve taken a photo of romance itself rather well.', '2006-02-07 19:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130751, 286774, 25678, '<td valign="top">i like the idea.  The table seems a bit crooked though</td>', 'i like the idea.  The table seems a bit crooked though', '2006-02-07 19:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130756, 288945, 41337, '<td valign="top">This is creative but overall the photo isn''t every appealing IMO. The lines is the biggest problem for me here. Perhaps if you shot something that had more suggestive/curvy lines it would have really worked for the theme.</td>', 'This is creative but overall the photo isn''t every appealing IMO. The lines is the biggest problem for me here. Perhaps if you shot something that had more suggestive/curvy lines it would have really worked for the theme.', '2006-02-07 19:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130757, 289254, 25678, '<td valign="top">I think I understand this picture.  Nicely thinking out of the box, but I find the execution of the photo un-interesting, which is why I can''t score this very high</td>', 'I think I understand this picture.  Nicely thinking out of the box, but I find the execution of the photo un-interesting, which is why I can''t score this very high', '2006-02-07 19:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130758, 288174, 25678, '<td valign="top">Nice dress!  The highlights seem a touch blown out to me</td>', 'Nice dress!  The highlights seem a touch blown out to me', '2006-02-07 19:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130767, 289029, 41337, '<td valign="top">Distant as in the opposite of romance? Good photo nonetheless.</td>', 'Distant as in the opposite of romance? Good photo nonetheless.', '2006-02-07 19:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130769, 288073, 32133, '<td valign="top">This picture is quite romantic!  Love the high key.  Good luck on this one...</td>', 'This picture is quite romantic!  Love the high key.  Good luck on this one...', '2006-02-07 19:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
