(2130783, 288934, 41337, '<td valign="top">Fits the theme beautifully. Would have loved to see the model''s eyes, which I think could have also given this a seductive look. It''s an excellent photo regardless.</td>', 'Fits the theme beautifully. Would have loved to see the model''s eyes, which I think could have also given this a seductive look. It''s an excellent photo regardless.', '2006-02-07 20:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130786, 289342, 32133, '<td valign="top">Aaah, another flower shot.  Fortunately this one really stands out.  It is really beautiful.  I love the lighting and depth of field. Great shot</td>', 'Aaah, another flower shot.  Fortunately this one really stands out.  It is really beautiful.  I love the lighting and depth of field. Great shot', '2006-02-07 20:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
