(2130806, 289230, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. The diamond however shoud stand out more. Maybe a fill light or dodge/burn in postprocess? I also think perhaps you should have gone borderless or maybe a solid black or white border instead to compliment the elegant look?</td>', 'Nice photo. The diamond however shoud stand out more. Maybe a fill light or dodge/burn in postprocess? I also think perhaps you should have gone borderless or maybe a solid black or white border instead to compliment the elegant look?', '2006-02-07 20:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
