(2130809, 289376, 25678, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I just wish that blue tinge wasn''t in the bottom corners, or that it was in the top corners.  It feels a touch off balance</td>', 'Very nice.  I just wish that blue tinge wasn''t in the bottom corners, or that it was in the top corners.  It feels a touch off balance', '2006-02-07 20:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130810, 287351, 25678, '<td valign="top">great lines in this</td>', 'great lines in this', '2006-02-07 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130813, 288645, 25678, '<td valign="top">great capture!</td>', 'great capture!', '2006-02-07 20:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130829, 287714, 41337, '<td valign="top">Always nice to see real people. Great photo.</td>', 'Always nice to see real people. Great photo.', '2006-02-07 20:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130830, 286131, 32133, '<td valign="top">Too small!!!  I''m sure that''s not the first time you''ll hear that.  Cute dogs.</td>', 'Too small!!!  I''m sure that''s not the first time you''ll hear that.  Cute dogs.', '2006-02-07 20:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130832, 288932, 32133, '<td valign="top">Love the monochromatic feel.  Great lighting, great focus.  I really like it.</td>', 'Love the monochromatic feel.  Great lighting, great focus.  I really like it.', '2006-02-07 20:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130838, 288317, 51255, '<td valign="top">I''m a little unsure about this shot, to say the least. At first I thought you''d captured lust and desire, since this shot appears to be based on temptation and taking, rather than giving. Plus, if I''m not mistaken, Eve rather betrayed Adam with the whole apple thing? - the snake and the apple do rather appear to point out the wicked/selfish side of things.<br/> <br/>...HOWEVER, if she''s ignoring the snake and the apple (and she does rather seem to be concentrating on flirting with the camera with her eyes, lips and shoulders) then that could be a good case for romance. <br/> <br/>She''s also hiding herself with her arms, which denotes playing hard to get, and I don''t know if that comes under romance or lust, since it links into both in a flirty way. I hope this makes some sense...</td>', 'I''m a little unsure about this shot, to say the least. At first I thought you''d captured lust and desire, since this shot appears to be based on temptation and taking, rather than giving. Plus, if I''m not mistaken, Eve rather betrayed Adam with the whole apple thing? - the snake and the apple do rather appear to point out the wicked/selfish side of things. ...HOWEVER, if she''s ignoring the snake and the apple (and she does rather seem to be concentrating on flirting with the camera with her eyes, lips and shoulders) then that could be a good case for romance.  She''s also hiding herself with her arms, which denotes playing hard to get, and I don''t know if that comes under romance or lust, since it links into both in a flirty way. I hope this makes some sense...', '2006-02-07 20:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130840, 288621, 32133, '<td valign="top">Looks more like freaky attraction than romance.  Or maybe that''s what it looks like at 23, I can''t remember!  By the way, nice highlights on her hair.</td>', 'Looks more like freaky attraction than romance.  Or maybe that''s what it looks like at 23, I can''t remember!  By the way, nice highlights on her hair.', '2006-02-07 20:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130841, 288621, 41337, '<td valign="top">LOL</td>', 'LOL', '2006-02-07 20:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130845, 285902, 32133, '<td valign="top">Looks like a pretty nice place to be.</td>', 'Looks like a pretty nice place to be.', '2006-02-07 20:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130850, 289183, 41337, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what this is without the title. Might make for a good abstract however the highlights are just way too distracting IMO.</td>', 'I can''t tell what this is without the title. Might make for a good abstract however the highlights are just way too distracting IMO.', '2006-02-07 20:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130854, 289361, 32133, '<td valign="top">I love it.  I love her shoes most, but every thing else is great too.  Best so far</td>', 'I love it.  I love her shoes most, but every thing else is great too.  Best so far', '2006-02-07 20:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130864, 285960, 41337, '<td valign="top">I would be interested to see how a landscape crop of this might look. As a portrait the two look a little too cramped, IMO. As perhaps sharpening it just a hair although I do like the soft focus.</td>', 'I would be interested to see how a landscape crop of this might look. As a portrait the two look a little too cramped, IMO. As perhaps sharpening it just a hair although I do like the soft focus.', '2006-02-07 20:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130874, 285840, 41337, '<td valign="top">I really like the color, composition and shapes in this photo. One thing that I think would improve this is if the background was more out of focus. However, you did a good job of lining up a dark area of the background for the yellow flowers.</td>', 'I really like the color, composition and shapes in this photo. One thing that I think would improve this is if the background was more out of focus. However, you did a good job of lining up a dark area of the background for the yellow flowers.', '2006-02-07 20:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130896, 288780, 41337, '<td valign="top">I really like the foreground image. It''s very sharp and pleasing to the eye. I don''t really like the background which looks like fire and also the photo in the frame should be in focus also. Perhaps have it at the mid point between the ring and the background?</td>', 'I really like the foreground image. It''s very sharp and pleasing to the eye. I don''t really like the background which looks like fire and also the photo in the frame should be in focus also. Perhaps have it at the mid point between the ring and the background?', '2006-02-07 20:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130905, 286171, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed/composition. I like the choice of b/w and how you have everything in focus. I can''t think of anything I''d change or improve upon this. Well done.</td>', 'Nicely framed/composition. I like the choice of b/w and how you have everything in focus. I can''t think of anything I''d change or improve upon this. Well done.', '2006-02-07 20:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130910, 287874, 41337, '<td valign="top">The white edges and the size of the photo are negatives for me. Looks like a shot otherwise.</td>', 'The white edges and the size of the photo are negatives for me. Looks like a shot otherwise.', '2006-02-07 20:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130928, 289166, 41337, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the lighting and the contrast could use some boosting as well. Also might do better if red was more saturated in this photo. Composition wise it''s interesting. You managed to get a lot in here without it looking too busy.</td>', 'I don''t like the lighting and the contrast could use some boosting as well. Also might do better if red was more saturated in this photo. Composition wise it''s interesting. You managed to get a lot in here without it looking too busy.', '2006-02-07 20:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130945, 287388, 41337, '<td valign="top">I think if you reduced the noise and perhaps sharpen this a bit it might look better.</td>', 'I think if you reduced the noise and perhaps sharpen this a bit it might look better.', '2006-02-07 20:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130965, 289174, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the mood here. Soft yet sharp enough at the same time. The only negative I have is the green leaves make the photo a little busy at the bottom. I much rather see just the stem and the two hands.</td>', 'I like the mood here. Soft yet sharp enough at the same time. The only negative I have is the green leaves make the photo a little busy at the bottom. I much rather see just the stem and the two hands.', '2006-02-07 20:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130972, 289089, 41337, '<td valign="top">I love the setup of this. The folds in the fabric really go well with these pugs.</td>', 'I love the setup of this. The folds in the fabric really go well with these pugs.', '2006-02-07 20:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130993, 286921, 41337, '<td valign="top">I think what I would have done here is shot those sneakers (in the way you laid them) on a basketball court or sidewalk pavement. The carpeting just seems out of place for these sneakers and it doesn''t add anything to the shot, IMO.</td>', 'I think what I would have done here is shot those sneakers (in the way you laid them) on a basketball court or sidewalk pavement. The carpeting just seems out of place for these sneakers and it doesn''t add anything to the shot, IMO.', '2006-02-07 20:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130996, 289111, 41337, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. Love the bokeh.</td>', 'Great lighting. Love the bokeh.', '2006-02-07 20:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2131004, 288612, 41337, '<td valign="top">Just not romantic enough. Maybe if there was a sky in the background instead of a fence?</td>', 'Just not romantic enough. Maybe if there was a sky in the background instead of a fence?', '2006-02-07 20:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2131010, 287699, 41337, '<td valign="top">Great looking photo. Although I really like the color based on the title I think I might have gone b/w.</td>', 'Great looking photo. Although I really like the color based on the title I think I might have gone b/w.', '2006-02-07 20:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2131029, 288152, 52962, '<td valign="top">love your picture!  Like the wet floor and the black and white!</td>', 'love your picture!  Like the wet floor and the black and white!', '2006-02-07 21:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2131063, 288609, 45596, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2006-02-07 21:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2131066, 287762, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and the focus. However I think the color and tone could be improved here. I went ahead and played with this a bit using the basic editing and here is what I came up with (see below). This may not be the direction you were going but perhaps it''ll help in some way. Anyway, I hope you don''t mind me doing this. I do like your photo in general. <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=292776" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/41337/thumb/292776.jpg?0'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/41337/thumb/292776.jpg?0'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/41337/thumb/292776.jpg?0"/></a> <br/> <br/>If by any chance you do like it I can send you the photoshop file if you wish. Just PM me.</td>', 'I like the pose and the focus. However I think the color and tone could be improved here. I went ahead and played with this a bit using the basic editing and here is what I came up with (see below). This may not be the direction you were going but perhaps it''ll help in some way. Anyway, I hope you don''t mind me doing this. I do like your photo in general.    If by any chance you do like it I can send you the photoshop file if you wish. Just PM me.', '2006-02-07 21:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2131072, 289384, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I like how you composed this. Too bad you can''t spot edit that dot in the corner in basic editing.</td>', 'Very interesting. I like how you composed this. Too bad you can''t spot edit that dot in the corner in basic editing.', '2006-02-07 21:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2131075, 288126, 45596, '<td valign="top">The photo needs to be larger.  The photo has a snap shot feel to it.</td>', 'The photo needs to be larger.  The photo has a snap shot feel to it.', '2006-02-07 21:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
