(2131089, 288633, 41337, '<td valign="top">I really like the sharpness of the ring and the area around it. What I don''t like is the transition the hand has with the background. The out of focus part doesn''t bother me but the difference of color does. As such the diagonal line it creates takes too much of the focus away from the ring. Maybe if the background was black the transition would look better and being black it might also enhance the elegant nature of this photo and make the hands pop out in general being that it''s the lighter color.</td>', 'I really like the sharpness of the ring and the area around it. What I don''t like is the transition the hand has with the background. The out of focus part doesn''t bother me but the difference of color does. As such the diagonal line it creates takes too much of the focus away from the ring. Maybe if the background was black the transition would look better and being black it might also enhance the elegant nature of this photo and make the hands pop out in general being that it''s the lighter color.', '2006-02-07 21:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2131092, 289425, 52516, '<td valign="top">A perfect way to show someone you love them.</td>', 'A perfect way to show someone you love them.', '2006-02-07 21:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2131095, 286857, 41337, '<td valign="top">I think you should have had the sun shine through between their lips. Maybe leave some space between the two as they kiss. As is my eyes want to go towards the sun and not their kiss.</td>', 'I think you should have had the sun shine through between their lips. Maybe leave some space between the two as they kiss. As is my eyes want to go towards the sun and not their kiss.', '2006-02-07 21:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
