(2132475, 287584, 47711, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all who commented this shot.<br/>I saw that a lot of people considered this shot a bit off-topic.<br/>As I usually do, my approach started opening the dictionary and for the word Romance I got:<br/>====- romance -===============================================<br/>n. love affair, amour; tall tale, tale filled with exaggeration; narrative or poem about chivalry and/or heroic adventures (esp. from the Middle Ages) <br/> <br/>v. have a love affair with; tell stories filled with exaggeration, tell tall tales <br/>================================================================<br/> <br/>So I tried to represent the creation process of a Romance and as bakerb72 said maybe it should have been "Romance lacking inspiration" :)<br/> <br/>Thanks again, guys</td>', 'Thanks to all who commented this shot.I saw that a lot of people considered this shot a bit off-topic.As I usually do, my approach started opening the dictionary and for the word Romance I got:====- romance -===============================================n. love affair, amour; tall tale, tale filled with exaggeration; narrative or poem about chivalry and/or heroic adventures (esp. from the Middle Ages)  v. have a love affair with; tell stories filled with exaggeration, tell tall tales ================================================================ So I tried to represent the creation process of a Romance and as bakerb72 said maybe it should have been "Romance lacking inspiration" :) Thanks again, guys', '2006-02-08 03:27:29.000000', NULL, 0),
