(2132931, 288740, 48471, '<td valign="top">I''m comming back again and again to this photo to understand why is that "I love you...(heart)" written... Indeed, why?<br/>I see an excellent portrait, wonderful eyes and smile. But, the model is not young, ok, doesn''t look childish enough to write a message in the hand. She can convey that message in many other ways...At least, she could have written something like "Je t''aime", "ich liebe Dich", or keep only the heart, as not to have this long kitchy message.<br/>Sometimes people give terrible votes to great photos because the photo didn''t meet the challenge. I feel that here, the message was written to keep the photo romantic.<br/> <br/>Or, I''m missing something really huge?</td>', 'I''m comming back again and again to this photo to understand why is that "I love you...(heart)" written... Indeed, why?I see an excellent portrait, wonderful eyes and smile. But, the model is not young, ok, doesn''t look childish enough to write a message in the hand. She can convey that message in many other ways...At least, she could have written something like "Je t''aime", "ich liebe Dich", or keep only the heart, as not to have this long kitchy message.Sometimes people give terrible votes to great photos because the photo didn''t meet the challenge. I feel that here, the message was written to keep the photo romantic. Or, I''m missing something really huge?', '2006-02-08 07:30:24.000000', NULL, 0),
