(2132947, 289151, 48471, '<td valign="top">The first thing I thought of when I saw this photo was the comic where a tooth brush and toilet paper were complaining to each other about how lousy their jobs were. It''s nice to see a photo where toothbrushes have some nice moments in life, as well.</td>', 'The first thing I thought of when I saw this photo was the comic where a tooth brush and toilet paper were complaining to each other about how lousy their jobs were. It''s nice to see a photo where toothbrushes have some nice moments in life, as well.', '2006-02-08 07:35:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2133028, 289106, 48471, '<td valign="top">I think the red is quite nice, but the bright ribbon and the dark glass lack a lot. The ring is lost in the midst of so many things, it''s difficult for me to see it. And, once I see it, it doesn''t strike me as a ring of proposal. So, I think this photo didn''t do much technically, while the story is missing completely.<br/>One observation: at photographer''s comments it''s mentioned a glass and a wedding ring, but the first thing I see is the ribbon.</td>', 'I think the red is quite nice, but the bright ribbon and the dark glass lack a lot. The ring is lost in the midst of so many things, it''s difficult for me to see it. And, once I see it, it doesn''t strike me as a ring of proposal. So, I think this photo didn''t do much technically, while the story is missing completely.One observation: at photographer''s comments it''s mentioned a glass and a wedding ring, but the first thing I see is the ribbon.', '2006-02-08 07:50:45.000000', NULL, 0),
