(2133106, 287552, 40376, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments and suggestions on my 1st ever photo and challenge submission on this site.<br/>The swans were doing some sort of ritual with each other ( yes.. probably that one ! ) so I watched them for a while and took several shots out of interest until they formed the heart shape you see here.<br/>Peoples criticisms are fine but in direct sunlight this is exactly how it looked. The swans were almost glowing. I''d have increased the shutter speed but would have been to dark and I''d have lost the detail in the water. <br/>As for the people who would have preffered " Still water " again these are elements that although noted are out of my control !<br/>Thanks to those that liked this and congrats to all the ribbons !</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments and suggestions on my 1st ever photo and challenge submission on this site.The swans were doing some sort of ritual with each other ( yes.. probably that one ! ) so I watched them for a while and took several shots out of interest until they formed the heart shape you see here.Peoples criticisms are fine but in direct sunlight this is exactly how it looked. The swans were almost glowing. I''d have increased the shutter speed but would have been to dark and I''d have lost the detail in the water. As for the people who would have preffered " Still water " again these are elements that although noted are out of my control !Thanks to those that liked this and congrats to all the ribbons !', '2006-02-08 08:33:11.000000', NULL, 0),
