(2133922, 287123, 5728, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all your comments and votes. I was a little indecisive about entering this as I know DPC and I know that a photo like this doesn''t always go down so well. But looking at the votes I am happy with the outcome. Only 2 "ones", 5 "twos" and 8 "threes"! I was expecting a lot more :)</td>', 'Thank you for all your comments and votes. I was a little indecisive about entering this as I know DPC and I know that a photo like this doesn''t always go down so well. But looking at the votes I am happy with the outcome. Only 2 "ones", 5 "twos" and 8 "threes"! I was expecting a lot more :)', '2006-02-08 13:13:05.000000', NULL, 0),
