(2134104, 289151, 3306, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by anthonytuck:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m surprised by your score. I thought this was a really smart and creative image. I thought it would do better. Democracy''s a weird thing. Regardless, it is a great picture. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I thought it would do a little better too. I am surprised by the number of 1''s and 2''s. Either these people did not understand the humor, thought it was too risque or thought it represented lust or passion more that it did romance!! Oh well, on to the next challenge.</td>', 'Originally posted by anthonytuck: I''m surprised by your score. I thought this was a really smart and creative image. I thought it would do better. Democracy''s a weird thing. Regardless, it is a great picture.   I thought it would do a little better too. I am surprised by the number of 1''s and 2''s. Either these people did not understand the humor, thought it was too risque or thought it represented lust or passion more that it did romance!! Oh well, on to the next challenge.', '2006-02-08 14:00:05.000000', NULL, 0),
