(2134801, 288958, 11960, '<td valign="top">I voted this one middle of the road during the challenge. A couple of reasons. <br/> <br/>First, I didn''t really say romance to me. Of all the reasons I had, that one plyed into my voting the least, because I realize how subjective that is. <br/> <br/>Second, there are sharpening artifacts and jaggies on the edge of your plate and heart. This is something that can be avoided, and for whatever reason drives me bonkers. <br/> <br/>Next, the color cast. The whites in this image seem to have a tinge of pink in them. I assume it''s reflection from the heart. It give the image a warmer feel, but your white aren''t white... <br/> <br/>Finally, there''s what I''m going to assume is senosr dust dotted over the image... I know it''s basic editing, but you may want to physically clean that...<br/> <br/>Hope this helps! =] Trey</td>', 'I voted this one middle of the road during the challenge. A couple of reasons.  First, I didn''t really say romance to me. Of all the reasons I had, that one plyed into my voting the least, because I realize how subjective that is.  Second, there are sharpening artifacts and jaggies on the edge of your plate and heart. This is something that can be avoided, and for whatever reason drives me bonkers.  Next, the color cast. The whites in this image seem to have a tinge of pink in them. I assume it''s reflection from the heart. It give the image a warmer feel, but your white aren''t white...  Finally, there''s what I''m going to assume is senosr dust dotted over the image... I know it''s basic editing, but you may want to physically clean that... Hope this helps! =] Trey', '2006-02-08 16:52:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2134803, 288958, 37818, '<td valign="top">Just my 2 cents from doing a million dessert plates, etc.. I would always use odd numbers, 3 chocolates, or 5 rather then the 4. The sauce on the plate is distracting,  Freehand piping of straight lines is tough. And we do not usually serve these kind of chocolates or petit fours with a sauce, it looks a little odd...A strawberry tart on that plate would kick butt :)<br/> <br/>Sorry I can''t resist a food critique :) If I can ever been of any help, feel free to pm me</td>', 'Just my 2 cents from doing a million dessert plates, etc.. I would always use odd numbers, 3 chocolates, or 5 rather then the 4. The sauce on the plate is distracting,  Freehand piping of straight lines is tough. And we do not usually serve these kind of chocolates or petit fours with a sauce, it looks a little odd...A strawberry tart on that plate would kick butt :) Sorry I can''t resist a food critique :) If I can ever been of any help, feel free to pm me', '2006-02-08 16:53:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2134809, 288958, 42025, '<td valign="top">Ok to set the stage here I would like to first say I really enjoy looking at your work, you have a great visual quality and clarity to you shots and alot of attetion to color. That aside If I did not know you are who took this shot I would not have assoicated it with you. The shot is technacally very good the DOF is great lighting is good and your usual detail and color attetion. That aside I don''t really like the extreme tilt (remember this is just my opinion and I am far from an expert) Also and more importanly to me there is not a huge attetion or draw factor to me that seems like "Wow that is romance" while you have the candy and the heart box to me that does not show romance and feels more like a advertisement for candy (which isnt a bad thing in my opinion) Over all I would have scored this shot a 7 range because it was a well executed shot but just didn''t have that extra draw to me that says this is the embodiement of romance.....Now I need to get some chocolate ;)</td>', 'Ok to set the stage here I would like to first say I really enjoy looking at your work, you have a great visual quality and clarity to you shots and alot of attetion to color. That aside If I did not know you are who took this shot I would not have assoicated it with you. The shot is technacally very good the DOF is great lighting is good and your usual detail and color attetion. That aside I don''t really like the extreme tilt (remember this is just my opinion and I am far from an expert) Also and more importanly to me there is not a huge attetion or draw factor to me that seems like "Wow that is romance" while you have the candy and the heart box to me that does not show romance and feels more like a advertisement for candy (which isnt a bad thing in my opinion) Over all I would have scored this shot a 7 range because it was a well executed shot but just didn''t have that extra draw to me that says this is the embodiement of romance.....Now I need to get some chocolate ;)', '2006-02-08 16:54:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2134878, 289089, 25678, '<td valign="top">Yah!!! Congratulations!!</td>', 'Yah!!! Congratulations!!', '2006-02-08 17:29:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2134970, 287699, 29404, '<td valign="top">thanks every one for the votes and the specially the comments..so far the best i made on that site...with all of that beautiful shots the 27th is not bad at all<br/> <br/>thanks again</td>', 'thanks every one for the votes and the specially the comments..so far the best i made on that site...with all of that beautiful shots the 27th is not bad at all thanks again', '2006-02-08 18:03:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2134999, 287699, 15711, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your personal best.</td>', 'Congrats on your personal best.', '2006-02-08 18:15:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135131, 289425, 42005, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your very high finish!</td>', 'Congrats on your very high finish!', '2006-02-08 19:04:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135171, 288286, 40718, '<td valign="top">The biggest problem I see is that the fire pattern that the guy is making blocks both their faces.  Way too bad!  I really like the creativity and idea of this shot, but that hurts the picture fairly seriously.  Had you been able to frame them inside the big section the pattern creates, I think you would have been onto something.  There might be a slight color cast to the picture and there are two strange artifacts on their legs.  A shot which had potential to go far though...</td>', 'The biggest problem I see is that the fire pattern that the guy is making blocks both their faces.  Way too bad!  I really like the creativity and idea of this shot, but that hurts the picture fairly seriously.  Had you been able to frame them inside the big section the pattern creates, I think you would have been onto something.  There might be a slight color cast to the picture and there are two strange artifacts on their legs.  A shot which had potential to go far though...', '2006-02-08 19:23:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135179, 288958, 40718, '<td valign="top">the plate blends into the background which I think adds confusion.  The chocolates, in my eye, are too arranged.  I''d prefer a bit more asymmetrical in composition.  I like cropping part of the heart off.  Man that is one big old sensor booger...</td>', 'the plate blends into the background which I think adds confusion.  The chocolates, in my eye, are too arranged.  I''d prefer a bit more asymmetrical in composition.  I like cropping part of the heart off.  Man that is one big old sensor booger...', '2006-02-08 19:26:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135221, 288073, 40718, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good shot in the wrong challenge.  I didn''t vote romance, but I''d be hard pressed to think this represents it in any conventional sort of way.  I agree the shadow is a bit distracting, but I''m not sure how you''d get rid of it.  And to think I thought you were the "eve" of the last few challenges.  I knew you had a propensity for nakedness, but I guessed wrong. :)</td>', 'I think this is a good shot in the wrong challenge.  I didn''t vote romance, but I''d be hard pressed to think this represents it in any conventional sort of way.  I agree the shadow is a bit distracting, but I''m not sure how you''d get rid of it.  And to think I thought you were the "eve" of the last few challenges.  I knew you had a propensity for nakedness, but I guessed wrong. :)', '2006-02-08 19:46:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135518, 288876, 52497, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a photo contest not a childish jab contest. You all need to grow up. To those of you that made made mature comments that were actually about photography, thank you for the advice.</td>', 'I thought this was a photo contest not a childish jab contest. You all need to grow up. To those of you that made made mature comments that were actually about photography, thank you for the advice.', '2006-02-08 22:11:43.000000', NULL, 0),
