(2136301, 287123, 92, '<td valign="top">Beautiful models...beautiful photo...very romantic !<br/>I always miss you and your style of photography when you aren''t around. Thank you for ALL your first !</td>', 'Beautiful models...beautiful photo...very romantic !I always miss you and your style of photography when you aren''t around. Thank you for ALL your first !', '2006-02-09 07:51:48.000000', NULL, 0),
