(2136537, 287123, 14603, '<td valign="top">Just when I thought it was safe to come out and play..back he comes !!!<br/> <br/>Seriously, good to see you back in action Gary and continuing where you left off :)<br/>Congratulations.</td>', 'Just when I thought it was safe to come out and play..back he comes !!! Seriously, good to see you back in action Gary and continuing where you left off :)Congratulations.', '2006-02-09 09:58:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2136752, 288073, 46470, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid far too many people completely misunderstand any aspects of BDSM to see the love involved in it.<br/>Loved the cold stark lighting which enhanced the feigned helplessness.<br/>Found the pose a bit too awkward looking.<br/>Overall a very good picture and a much underated score.</td>', 'I''m afraid far too many people completely misunderstand any aspects of BDSM to see the love involved in it.Loved the cold stark lighting which enhanced the feigned helplessness.Found the pose a bit too awkward looking.Overall a very good picture and a much underated score.', '2006-02-09 11:52:28.000000', NULL, 0),
