(2137017, 288073, 24983, '<td valign="top">I''ll admit to a 1 for this image.It was in fact I thought like Artyste a picture not with Romance but about abuse against women, I am not in the least narrow minded as my own entry will show. I also did not do well in this challenge as the connections were not obvious to many, <br/>In itself your image was adequate but I think you touched a few raw nerves with it.</td>', 'I''ll admit to a 1 for this image.It was in fact I thought like Artyste a picture not with Romance but about abuse against women, I am not in the least narrow minded as my own entry will show. I also did not do well in this challenge as the connections were not obvious to many, In itself your image was adequate but I think you touched a few raw nerves with it.', '2006-02-09 14:03:57.000000', NULL, 0),
