(2137780, 287592, 7810, '<td valign="top">I like this alot :)<br/>I Also like the idea as displayed in your off center shot. Great idea.<br/>Congrats on your yeller ribbon.</td>', 'I like this alot :)I Also like the idea as displayed in your off center shot. Great idea.Congrats on your yeller ribbon.', '2006-02-09 18:03:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137818, 286901, 72317, '<td valign="top">Ah, either an american garden toad or a canadian carpenter toad.. They dont bite, give warts, or foam out poison..<br/> <br/>Im surprised I dont see more pics like this on this site.. Its an okay shot, but I think it couldve been rated higher if it wasnt such a closeup, her hair was under control, and the toad was sitting in her hand (but I dont blame her for not wanting to touch it! They urinate when disturbed) I would have atleast had the toad come at a lower angle with his forelegs resting on something. A boulder, perhaps? Still, VERY clever idea! =)</td>', 'Ah, either an american garden toad or a canadian carpenter toad.. They dont bite, give warts, or foam out poison.. Im surprised I dont see more pics like this on this site.. Its an okay shot, but I think it couldve been rated higher if it wasnt such a closeup, her hair was under control, and the toad was sitting in her hand (but I dont blame her for not wanting to touch it! They urinate when disturbed) I would have atleast had the toad come at a lower angle with his forelegs resting on something. A boulder, perhaps? Still, VERY clever idea! =)', '2006-02-09 18:17:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2138147, 287123, 49561, '<td valign="top">Wow! Extremely sensual. Great job!</td>', 'Wow! Extremely sensual. Great job!', '2006-02-09 19:35:32.000000', NULL, 0),
