(2138199, 288876, 52497, '<td valign="top">Actually, these are not pantyhose(that would be weird?!), but a piece of sheer material that is a piece of the outfit draped over her leg. (Just thought I would clarify for the masses that don''t get it)</td>', 'Actually, these are not pantyhose(that would be weird?!), but a piece of sheer material that is a piece of the outfit draped over her leg. (Just thought I would clarify for the masses that don''t get it)', '2006-02-09 19:50:09.000000', NULL, 0),
