(2138526, 288092, 41574, '<td valign="top">I guess the reflection in the eyeglasses really did hurt. It didn''t occur to me as too detrimental, when I posted the shot. Thanks for your comments, guys.</td>', 'I guess the reflection in the eyeglasses really did hurt. It didn''t occur to me as too detrimental, when I posted the shot. Thanks for your comments, guys.', '2006-02-09 21:48:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2138538, 287592, 41574, '<td valign="top">I gave it a "10," and I think it should have gotten a blue ribbon. That said, a yellow is nothing to scoff at. Excellent work, and congratulations!</td>', 'I gave it a "10," and I think it should have gotten a blue ribbon. That said, a yellow is nothing to scoff at. Excellent work, and congratulations!', '2006-02-09 21:53:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2138570, 289341, 48471, '<td valign="top">I think this photo works better as a memory of a romance, rather than a romance in itself. I imaginge looking at the room where I meet the first love of my life and ... (put cheesy stuff). Now, being old, I come back to this place where love started.<br/>Technically though, I liked the B&amp;W choice, but it''s done quite harshly. I suspected that there''s something wrong with my monitor, but no: your photo has a cover of purple or violet or whatever the name of this colour is. I guess it would have helped a lot if you waited for the evening, or done it earlier in the morning, to get some better and more diffused light.</td>', 'I think this photo works better as a memory of a romance, rather than a romance in itself. I imaginge looking at the room where I meet the first love of my life and ... (put cheesy stuff). Now, being old, I come back to this place where love started.Technically though, I liked the B&W choice, but it''s done quite harshly. I suspected that there''s something wrong with my monitor, but no: your photo has a cover of purple or violet or whatever the name of this colour is. I guess it would have helped a lot if you waited for the evening, or done it earlier in the morning, to get some better and more diffused light.', '2006-02-09 22:03:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2138715, 287552, 10818, '<td valign="top">It took me a second look, after the contest ended, to see the heart.  Congrats on your top ten, wonderful photo.</td>', 'It took me a second look, after the contest ended, to see the heart.  Congrats on your top ten, wonderful photo.', '2006-02-09 22:58:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2138842, 286591, 49867, '<td valign="top">I want to see a picture of this guy in every single challenge. You are the MAN!!!!</td>', 'I want to see a picture of this guy in every single challenge. You are the MAN!!!!', '2006-02-09 23:47:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2138843, 287699, 47096, '<td valign="top">I think this may have been the only photo in this challenge that I gave a 10 to. It''s nice to see symbolism in a photo. Great job.</td>', 'I think this may have been the only photo in this challenge that I gave a 10 to. It''s nice to see symbolism in a photo. Great job.', '2006-02-09 23:47:37.000000', NULL, 0),
