(2139722, 289341, 50432, '<td valign="top">A very interesting photo!</td>', 'A very interesting photo!', '2006-02-10 08:56:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2140037, 289042, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nearly a 5.4 isn''t too bad a score.  The technicals aren''t bad, although the snow is completely blown.  Since it''s not really the subject, I don''t think it''s a big loss.  Perhaps I would have looked for a more interesting or dynamic composition.  This shot is a bit tight and a bit too centered.  It isn''t bad, but isn''t inspired either.</td>', 'Nearly a 5.4 isn''t too bad a score.  The technicals aren''t bad, although the snow is completely blown.  Since it''s not really the subject, I don''t think it''s a big loss.  Perhaps I would have looked for a more interesting or dynamic composition.  This shot is a bit tight and a bit too centered.  It isn''t bad, but isn''t inspired either.', '2006-02-10 11:24:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2140175, 289042, 26464, '<td valign="top">this is nice! makes me think of another title -heavy hearts-<br/></td>', 'this is nice! makes me think of another title -heavy hearts-', '2006-02-10 12:13:27.000000', NULL, 0),
